<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- Sefwi New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">1 KORINTOFOƐ</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Ko</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Korintofoɛ</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Korintofoɛ</para>
  <para style="mt1">KORINTOFOƐ</para>
  <para style="mt4">NWOMAA BƆ OLI MOA</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ip">Somafoɛ Paul yeɛ ɔhworɔle krataa he ɔ, na ɔhworɔle ye wɔ Efeso kɔyɛ afoɛ 55 Y.A.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Y.A kyire Yesu Aberɛ so (Brɔfo: </char><char style="it">Common Era</char> anaa <char style="it">C.E</char>)</note> Ɔhworɔ mane oliema Kristofoɛ bɔ ne bɛte Korinto ne.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ye nzɛmbatrɛ akwanduo bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ nanu ne, ɔtenane Korinto, na ɔbokale maa benyane asafo wɔ berɛ. Na ye nzɛmbatrɛ akwanduo bɔ ɔtɔ so nza nanu, mmerɛ bɔ né ɔwɔ Efeso ne, onyane krataa fili Korintofoɛ nemɔ berɛ. Afei koso, ebiemɔ bɔle ye amaneɛ kyɛ, nningyein pee kɔ so wɔ Korinto asafo nanu bɔ ɔttemaye.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kloe awurofoɛ nemɔ bie bɔle Paul amaneɛ kyɛ, né Korinto asafo nanu akyekyɛ, aliemaa biemɔ bɔ bra-bɔne, bɛsõ bosoen, na né besa bɛfa toa-pɛlɛ nwo dwirɛ bɛha b'adwene. Yeti Paul hworɔle krataa he, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɔkɔfa koli sɔ tebea nemɔ nwo dwumaa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Somafoɛ Paul maa bɛnwuni ye kyɛ, odikyɛ bɛbɔnu bɛyɛ adwuma maa nzɛmba né kɔ ye nyunu, bɛyakyi manzoin bɔ ɔwɔ bɛ nu ne, bɛboka bɛ bɔ bayɛ mmerɛ ne maa bɛ gyidie ne yɛ se, na bɛyere bɛ nwo bɛka nzɛmba ne bɛkyire bɛ bɔ bɛtte gyidifoɛ ne.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">ENU DWIRƐ</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngyeaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 1:1-3">1:1-3</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Edwirɛ bɔ ɔfa hyɛle yebo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 1:4-9">1:4-9</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kue ahoroɛ bɔ batete ye wɔ asafo nanu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 1:10-4:21">1:10–4:21</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Adwamammɔ ne abusua dwirɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 5:1-7:40">5:1–7:40</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kristofoɛ ne abosonsomfoɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 8:1-11:1">8:1–11:1</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bɔ ɔkɔmaa nikye biala kɔhɔ so pɛpɛɛpɛ wɔ asafo nanu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 11:2-14:40">11:2–14:40</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bɔ ɔmaa yɛnwu kyɛ bɛkotingye bɛ bɔ bawu ne (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 15:1-58">15:1-58</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Edwirɛ bɔ ɔpɛ yebo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 16:1-24">16:1-24</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <para style="ib" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Krataa he fi Paul, bɔ Nyameɛ adaworoma wafrɛ me kyɛ mmanyɛ Kristo Yesu somafoɛ, ɔne yɛliema Sostene berɛ;<verse eid="1CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />Yɛfa yɛkɔma Nyameɛ asafo bɔ ɔwɔ Korinto ne. Metworɔ mebrɛ ɛmɔ bɔ bate ɛmɔ nwo wɔ Kristo Yesu nu, na bafrɛ ɛmɔ kyɛ ɛmɔɔyɛ akrongronfoɛ, ɔne bɛ bɔ bɛbɔ y'Awurade Yesu Kristo dumaa wɔ nekaa biala ne; ɔte yɛ ne bɛ mukoraati Awurade:<verse eid="1CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Adom ne asomdwie bɔ ofi yɛ Baba Nyameɛ ne y'Awurade Yesu Kristo berɛ ha ɛmɔ.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Nyameɛ adom bɔ wafa wama ɛmɔ wɔ Kristo Yesu nu nati, daa meda Nyameɛ ase mema ɛmɔ, <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />na ye ti, ɛmɔ anya nikye biala maa waboso, dwudwolɛ ne nimdeɛ mukoraati, <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />na sɔ ala yeɛ Kristo nwo adanzeɛ ne atira ndii wɔ ɛmɔ nu ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />Yeti, ɛmɔle akyɛdeɛ namukoraati bie, na ɛmɔ nwondɛ paa kyɛ y'Awurade Yesu Kristo kɔla ye nwo ali. <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Na ɔkɔmaa ɛmɔ bo kotimu koodwu awieɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a y'Awurade Yesu Kristo kyẽa ne, edwirɛ biala ngɔwa ɛmɔ nwo ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Nyameɛ bɔ wafrɛ ɛmɔ kyɛ ɛmɔ ne Ɔwa bɔ yeɛ ole y'Awurade Yesu Kristo fa adamvoa ne, ɔte ebie bɔ odi nahorɛ.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Aliemaa mɔ, mefa y'Awurade Yesu Kristo dumaa mesrɛ ɛmɔ kyɛ, ɛmɔ mukoraati, ɛmɔnya adwene kõ, ná mbakye-mbakye-muɛ biala amma ɛmɔ nu. Ná wamaa ɛmɔ mukoraati ɛmɔ ayɛ kõ wɔ adwene kõ, ne nzusuyɛɛ kõ nu. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Nniema mɔ, Kloe awurofoɛ nemɔ bie abɔ me amaneɛ kyɛ, ɛmɔ afia ndwo koraa. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Bɔ mekyire yeɛ ole kyɛ, edwirɛ bɔ ɛmɔ nu biala ka yeɛ ole kyɛ: “Nde Paul deɛ,” “Me de, nde Apolo deɛ,” ebiemɔ koso nwa “Nde Kefa deɛ,” yeɛ “Nde Kristo deɛ.” <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Ma mmisa ɛmɔ, Kristo nu akyekyɛ hɔ? Ná Paul yeɛ bɛbɔle ye asɛnnua nu bɛmane ɛmɔ hɔ? Anaa bɛbɔle ɛmɔ asu wɔ Paul dumaa nu? <verse eid="1CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Meda Nyameɛ ase paa kyɛ mammɔ ɛmɔ nu biala asu, sana Krispo ne Gaius, <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />ná wamma ɛmɔ nu biala anga kyɛ me dumaa nu yeɛ ɔbɔle asu ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />Ɔwɔ nu, nza mmɔle Stefana awurofoɛ asu, nakoso ɛhene si ne, mengaye kyɛ mmɔle ebiala asu. <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Ofikyɛ Kristo anzoma me kyɛ mma mmɔ asu, mmom mmanga nzɛmba ne, na nná sona nyanza yeɛ ɔfa somane me ɔ, ná Kristo asɛnnua né anyɛ mbaen.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Na bɛ bɔ bamini<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bɛsɛkye.”</char></note> ne de, asɛnnua nanwo dwirɛ ne te ngwaseasɛm ma bɛ, nakoso, yɛ bɔ bedɛ yɛ ngoa ne de, ɔte Nyameɛ tumi. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Na wahworɔ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">“Ngɔmaa anyansafoɛ nyanza kɔsɛkye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 1:19">na mamaa animdefoɛ nimdeɛ ayɛ mbaen.”<verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Nyanzaniɛ wɔ nisua? Na Ɔtwerɛfoɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ebie bɔ ɔse mmeraa ne yé.”</char></note> wɔ ni? Na bɔ osu aporowaa wɔ wiase nanu ne wɔ ni? Aso Nyameɛ mmane wiase nyanza yɛle ngwaseasɛm? <verse eid="1CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Ná Nyameɛ nyanza ti, wiase ne angora amva bɛ nyanza so annwu Ye, ná edwirɛ bɔ yɛka, bɔ wiase ne bu ye kyɛ ɔte ngwaseasɛm ne, ɛhene yeɛ Nyameɛ nye gye ye nwo kyɛ ɔkɔfa so kole bɛ bɔ bedɛ bɛdi ne ngoa ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Yudafoɛ pena nzɛngyerɛneɛ, na Greekfoɛ pena nyanza, <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />nakoso yɛ de, yɛka Kristo bɔ bɛbɔle ye asɛnnua nu nanwo dwirɛ. Sɔ dwirɛ ne, ɔto Yudafoɛ sintidua, na ɔte ngwaseasɛm ma maen-maen ne. <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />Nakoso bɛ bɔ bafrɛ bɛ ne de, Yudafoɛ oo, Greekfoɛ oo, Kristo te Nyameɛ tumi ne Nyameɛ nyanza ma bɛ. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Ofikyɛ Nyameɛ nikye bɔ bɛbu ye kyɛ ɔte ngwaseasɛm ne, ɔse nworɛ tra sona, na bɔ bɛnwu ye kyɛ ɔyɛ mmerɛ ne, ye nwo yɛ se tra sona.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Afei aliemaa mɔ, sɛ ɛmɔnea ɛfrɛlɛ bɔ ɔfrɛle ɛmɔ ne a, sona nye so de ɛmɔ nu pee nze nworɛ, pee nala lle tumi, ná pee nala tte nnehyeɛ. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Nakoso bɔ ewiase ne bu ye kyɛ ɔte ngwaseasɛm ne, ɛhene yeɛ Nyameɛ afa kyɛ ɔfa gua bɛ bɔ bɛse nworɛ ne nyunu ase; na bɔ bɛbu ye kyɛ ɔyɛ mmerɛ ne, wafa kyɛ ɔfa gua bɛ bɔ bɛ nwo yɛ se ne nyunu ase. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Na nningyein bɔ ewiase ne nwu ye kyɛ mvasoɛ nne so, bɛbu yɛ animtia, na bɛnwu ye kyɛ ɔtte hwee ne, ɛhene yeɛ Nyameɛ afa kyɛ ɔfa sɛkye nningyein bɔ ewiase ne nwu ye kyɛ ye nwo hia ne, <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ebiala ngɔhoɔhoa ye nwo wɔ ye nyunu ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Na Nyameɛ yeɛ wamaa ɛmɔ ne Kristo Yesu ayɛ kõ ne, Kristo bɔ wamaa yanwu Nyameɛ nyanza ne ye tenenee, ye yeɛ wate yɛ nwo, na ɔnate agyedeɛ naso alɛ́ yɛ, <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a bɔ bahworɔ ne kɔwa nu kyɛ: “Bɔ ɔhoɔhoa ye nwo ne, ma ɔhoɔhoa ye nwo wɔ Awurade nu.”<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Aliemaa mɔ, mmale ɛmɔ berɛ kyɛ mebaaha Nyameɛ dwirɛ krongron bɔ wafea né mekyire ɛmɔ ne, nná edwirɛ mbiri anaa sona nyanza yeɛ mva ngane ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Na mmerɛ bɔ nwɔ ɛmɔ berɛ ne, mmɔle me tianu kyɛ mengɔfa m'adwene mengosie hwee so, sana Yesu Kristo ne asɛnnua bɔ bɛbɔle ye nu ne. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Na nwɔ ɛmɔ berɛ ne, né meyɛ mmerɛ, né mesuro, na né me nwo popo. <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />Na edwirɛ bɔ ngane, ɔne ngyerɛkyerɛ bɔ nyɛle ne, nná nnaka-naka ne sona nyanza yeɛ mva ngane ɔ, mmom honhom né tumi, <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɛmɔ gyidie ngogyina sona nyanza so, mmom okogyina Nyameɛ tumi so.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Na yɛka nyanza nwo dwirɛ yɛkyire bɛbɔ bɛ nwo akwokwa ne,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bɛ bɔ banyi ne.”</char></note> nakoso, nná wiase he anu nyanza, anaa bɛ bɔ bɛdi wiase he aso ne nyanza, bɛ de ɔngɔhyɛ bɛkɔsɛkye bɛ. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Mmom yɛka nyanza bɔ ofi Nyameɛ berɛ, ɛhene yeɛ ole edwirɛ krongron bɔ wafea ne. Ɛhene yeɛ Nyameɛ hyehyɛ tole berɛ kora yeɛ bɛbɔ wiase ne, kyɛ ɔkɔfa kɔhyɛ yɛ anuonyam ne. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Sɔ nyanza ne, bɛ bɔ bɛte atumvoɛ wɔ wiase he anu ne, bɛ nu biala annwu ye. Sɛ bɛnwuni ye a, ahaa bangu Awurade bɔ bahyɛ ye anuonyam ne. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Na kyɛbɔ bahworɔ ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">“Bɔ Nyameɛ asiesie ama bɛ bɔ bɛdɔ ye ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">anyeɛ biala nnwuni ye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">asoɛ biala telle,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">na ɔwalle ebiala ahone nu lle.”<verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Nakoso, yɛ de, Nyameɛ nate honhom so aye ye ali ahyire yɛ. Na honhom ne neɛnea nikye biala nu, Nyameɛ nningyein bɔ enu kɔ ne po nu. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Nwa yeɛ ɔkora nwu ye mmango ti anu adwene ɔ? Ebiala nne berɛ, sana sona ne bɔbɔ. Sɔ ala yeɛ ebiala nze Nyameɛ ti anu dwirɛ, sana Nyameɛ honhom. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Na yɛ de, yannya wiase né honhom, mmom honhom bɔ ofi Nyameɛ berɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a yekonwu nningyein bɔ Nyameɛ afia ye kunu afa ahyɛ yɛ ne. <verse eid="1CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Na bɔ yɛka ne koso, nná bɔ bɛfale sona nyanza bɛhyirele yɛ yeɛ yɛka ɔ, mmom bɔ honhom ne hyirele yɛ ne. Na yɛfa honhom nu dwirɛ yɛkyirekyire honhom nu nningyein nu.<verse eid="1CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Na sona bɔ odi ye akɔnnɔ si ne de, onne nningyein bɔ ofi Nyameɛ honhom ne berɛ ne ndonu, na ɔte ngwaseasɛm po ma ye; na ɔngɔhora ngonwu nu, ofikyɛ honhom yeɛ bɛfa bɛneɛnea nu ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Na sona bɔ Nyameɛ honhom kyire ye atee ne de, ɔneɛnea nningyein mukoraati nu, nakoso ye de, ebiala nneɛnea ye nu. <verse eid="1CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />Na “nwa yeɛ wanwu Awurade adwene bɔ ɔkɔhora kohyirehyire ye ɔ?” Ná yɛ de, yɛle Kristo adwene.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Aliemaa mɔ, mene ɛmɔ angora andwudwo kyɛ mmenia bɔ honhom kyire bɛ atee, mmom kyɛ mmenia bɔ bɛli b'akɔnnɔ si, te kyɛ Kristo nu ngwalaa. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />Mmane ɛmɔ nyɔfonesue, mamma ɛmɔ aleɛ bɔ ɔyɛ se, ofikyɛ né ɛmɔ ngɔhora aleɛ bɔ ɔyɛ se di, na kesaalae po, ɛmɔ ngɔhora ye di, <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />ofikyɛ ɛmɔtɛ́ li ɛmɔ akɔnnɔ si. Na sɛ ahoɔyaa wɔ ɛmɔ nu, ná ɛmɔ afia ndwo a, ye de, nnaa ɛmɔ akɔnnɔ si yeɛ ɛmɔli ɔ? Na nná bɔ wiase ne yɛ ne bie yeɛ ɛmɔyɛ ne? <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Na sɛ ɛmɔ nu bie ka kyɛ “Nde Paul deɛ,” na foforɛ koso ka kyɛ “Nde Apolo deɛ” a, nná bɔ wiase ne yɛ ne biala yeɛ ɛmɔyɛ ne?<verse eid="1CO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Apolo yeɛ ole nwa? Na Paul koso yeɛ ole nwa? Yɛte asomvoɛ bɔ Awurade afa adwuma awura yɛ sa, bɔ ɛmɔ nate yɛ so bɛɛyɛle gyidifoɛ ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Me de, nnuale, Apolo koso guale so nzue, nakoso Nyameɛ yeɛ ɔmaa onyini ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Yeti bɔ oluale ne, ɔne bɔ oguale so nzue ne de, bɛtte hwee, Nyameɛ mmom yeɛ ɔyɛ nikye bie ɔ, ye yeɛ ɔmaa onyi ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Na bɔ oluale ne, ɔne bɔ oguale so nzue ne te kõ, na ebiala konya ye akatua kyɛbɔ ye adwuma te ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Ofikyɛ yɛne Nyameɛ yeɛ yɛyɛ adwuma ɔ, ɛmɔte Nyameɛ boo, Nyameɛ sua.<verse eid="1CO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Ɔnate adom bɔ Nyameɛ afa ama me nati, ndole fapem ne kyɛ berekyaniɛ bɔ ɔse adwuma paa, na sona foforɛ koso to ye deɛ sie so. Nakoso, odikyɛ ebiala nea bɔ ɔfa toa so ne yé. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Na Yesu Kristo yeɛ ole fapem bɔ bato ne, ye si ne, ebiala ngɔhora nngɔto fapem biala kõ. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Na sɛ ebie fa sikaa kɔkorɛ, dwetɛ, nyɔboɛ pa, bakaa, ɛserɛ, anaa ɛmo nwura toa fapem naso a, <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />ebiala adwuma kɔye ye nwo ali, ofikyɛ kyẽa ne kɔmaa ɔkɔla ali. Na see yeɛ ɔkɔmaa ɔkɔla ali ɔ, see ne yeɛ ɔkɔmaa yekonwu adwuma bɔ ebiala ayɛ ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Sɛ ebie adwuma bɔ wafa watoa fapem naso ne kora gyina see ne noa a, okonya ye nwo akatua, <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />na sɛ ɔyera a, ɔkɔhwere nikye, na ye bɔbɔ de, bɛkole ye ngoa. Nakoso ɔkɔyɛ kyɛ balɛ́ ye bafi see nu ne.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Aso, ɛmɔnze kyɛ ɛmɔte Nyameɛ asɔre Awuro, ma yeti Nyameɛ honhom te ɛmɔ nu? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Na sɛ ebie sɛkye Nyameɛ asɔre awuro ne a, Nyameɛ kɔsɛkye ye; ofikyɛ Nyameɛ asɔre awuro ne te krongron, na ɛmɔ yeɛ ɛmɔte asɔre awuro ne.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Nnɛmaa ebiala laka-laka ye nwo, sɛ ɛmɔ nu bie adwene yɛ ye kyɛ ɔse nworɛ wɔ wiase he anu a, ma ɔyɛ kwasea, na wamaa wanwu nworɛ. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Ofikyɛ ewiase he anu nyanza te ngwaseasɛm wɔ Nyameɛ nye so, na kyɛbɔ bahworɔ ne: “Ngaen bɔ anyanzafoɛ afa bɛ anyeteɛ aswa ne, ɔmaa ɔkye bɛ bɔbɔ.” <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />Na osa ka ye bieku kyɛ: “Awurade se kyɛ anyanzafoɛ nzusuyɛɛ te mbaen.” <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Yeti, nnɛmɔfa bɔ sona ayɛ bɛhoɔhoa ɛmɔ nwo, ofikyɛ nikye biala te ɛmɔ deɛ. <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />Yeti, Paul oo, Apolo oo, Kefa oo, ewiase oo, ngoa oo, ewue oo, bɔ ɔwɔ berɛ ɛnɛ oo, bɔ ɔkɔwa kyẽabie oo, ye mukoraati te ɛmɔ deɛ, <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />na ɛmɔte Kristo deɛ, yeɛ Kristo koso te Nyameɛ deɛ.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Odikyɛ mmenia nwu yɛ kyɛ yɛte Kristo asomvoɛ, na yɛnea Nyameɛ dwirɛ krongron bɔ wafea naso. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Yeti, ebiala bɔ ɔnea ebie awuro so ne, odikyɛ odi nahorɛ. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Na me de, sɛ ɛmɔ anaa sona foforɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔkɔhora kohyire kɔɔto.</char></note> bie bu me atɛn a,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Neɛnea me dwirɛ nu.”</char></note> ɔnhyɛ da nha me. Ofikyɛ me bɔbɔ, memmu me nwo atɛn. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Ofikyɛ me ahonim<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Tiboa.”</char></note> mmu me fɔ, nakoso, ɛhe ngyire kyɛ nde teneneeniɛ. Awurade yeɛ okobu me atɛn ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Yeti, kosi kyɛ mmerɛ ne kɔso ne, nnɛmɔbu nikye biala nwo atɛn, ɛmɔ nwondɛ ma Awurade bra. Ye yeɛ ɔkɔye edwirɛ bɔ wafea awosii nu namukoraati kofite, ná ɔkɔmaa yekonwu bɔ ɔwɔ ebiala ahone nu. Sɔ mmerɛ ne, ebiala konya ayɛyie bɔ ɔfata ye kofi Nyameɛ berɛ.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Aliemaa mɔ, ɛmɔ pa nu ti, mafa edwirɛ ne mafa me ne Apolo nwo, ná wamaa ɛmɔ asua ɛhe bafi yɛ berɛ, kyɛ: “Ɛmɔngɔyɛ nikye ma ɔngɔtra bɔ bahworɔ ne.” Na ɛmɔ amma ɛmɔ nwo so, bamva sona kõ bambɛ kõ poa. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Na nwa yeɛ wamaa atra wɔ mmango ɔ? Nzu yeɛ ele ye bɔ bamva bamma wɔ ɔ? Na sɛ bɛfa bɛmane wɔ a, nzuati yeɛ edwa wɔ noa nu kyɛ bamva bamma wɔ ne?<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Nnaa ɛmɔ sa aha bɔ ɛmɔpena ne dada?<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa: “Nnaa ɛmɔ ko ayi dada.”</char></note> Nnaa ɛmɔ anya ɛmɔ nwo bayie? Nnaa ɛmɔ ahyɛ yebo bɛdi hene bɔ yɛbokka so ɔ? Ɔhale me ngome a, ahaa ɛmɔ ahyɛ yebo bɛdi hene, na wamaa yɛne ɛmɔ abɔnu ali hene. <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Menwu ye kyɛ, Nyameɛ afa yɛ bɔ yɛte asomafoɛ ne apɛ ye bo, ná waye yɛ wahyire te kyɛ mmenia bɔ babu bɛ kumfɔ bɔ bɛkwaahu bɛ ne, ofikyɛ yayɛ nikye bɔ wiase ne, abɔfo, ne mmenia mukoraati nea yɛ ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Yɛ de, Kristo ti yɛte ngwaseafoɛ, nakoso ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔte anyanzafoɛ wɔ Kristo nu; yayɛ mmerɛ, na ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔ nwo yɛ se; bahyɛ ɛmɔ anuonyam, nakoso yɛ de, bɛbu yɛ animtia. <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Na ɛnɛ ne ɛnɛ po, ɛhɔen ne nzuhɔen ku yɛ, yɛ nwo la so, bɛbo yɛ, yɛlle nekaa bɔ yɛte ɔ, <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />na yɛyere yɛ nwo yɛfa yɛ sa yɛyɛ adwuma. Sɛ bɛpɛ yɛ nzoaa a, yɛhyira bɛ, sɛ bɛtane yɛ nye a, yɛmia yɛ nye yɛgyina nu; <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />sɛ bɛsɛkye yɛ dumaa a, yɛto yɛ bo ase yɛne bɛ dwudwo. Na ɔbaadwu ɛnɛ, yayɛ kyɛ bɔla wɔ wiase, yayɛ kyɛ nningyein mukoraati boso nwura.<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Mandworɔ ɛhe kyɛ mefa megua ɛmɔ nyunu ase, mmom mefa metu ɛmɔ fo kyɛ me mmaa bɔ mekuro ɛmɔ dwirɛ. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Sɛ ɛmɔle mmenia 10,000 bɔ bɛnea ɛmɔ wɔ Kristo nu po a, ɛmɔ baba mɔ de, bɛnzone, ofikyɛ me yeɛ nnate nzɛmba naso maayɛ ɛmɔ baba wɔ Kristo Yesu nu ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Yeti mesrɛ ɛmɔ, ɛmɔsuesua me. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Ɛhe ati mesoma Timoteo meba ɛmɔ berɛ, ɔte mma bɔ medɔ ye, na odi nahorɛ wɔ Awurade nu. Ɔkɔkaye ɛmɔ kyɛbɔ mebɔ me bra wɔ Kristo Yesu nu, kyɛbɔ mekyirekyire wɔ asafo biala nu, wɔ nekaa biala ne.<verse eid="1CO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Ɛmɔ nu biemɔ ama bɛ nwo so, te kyɛ ɛnwa mengɔwa berɛ. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Nakoso, sɛ Awurade ma atee a, ɔngɔhyɛ biala ngɔwa berɛ. Na ngonwu tumi bɔ bɛ bɔ bama bɛ nwo so ne le ye ne, ɔtte edwirɛ bɔ bɛkeka ne. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Ofikyɛ Nyameɛ Ahennie ne gyi tumi so, ɔtte dwudwolɛ. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Na beni yeɛ ɛmɔ kuro ɔ? Kain yeɛ mva mmera ɛmɔ so ɔ, anaa ɔdɔ ne honhom bɔ odwo?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Baabɔ yɛ amaneɛ kyɛ, adwamammɔ kɔ so wɔ ɛmɔ nu, adwamammɔ bɔ ɔngɔ so wɔ maen-maen ne po nu, yeɛ ole kyɛ, ebie alɛ́ ye baba aye. <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Ná ɛhe yeɛ ɛmɔfa bɛhoɔhoa ɛmɔ nwo ne? Odikyɛ ahaa ɔyɛ ɛmɔ aworabɔ, na ɛmɔye sɔ sona ne bɛfi ɛmɔ nu. <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Ɔwɔ nu, nne berɛ anwoɔnaen nu, nakoso nwɔ berɛ honhom nu, na mabu sɔ sona ne atɛn dada, te kyɛ ɛnwa nwɔ berɛ nala. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Sɛ ɛmɔyia nu wɔ y'Awurade Yesu dumaa nu, na ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ mene ɛmɔ wɔ berɛ honhom nu, bɔ y'Awurade Yesu tumi boka ɛmɔ so a, <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />ɛmɔye sɔ sona ne bɛwura Satan sa ma ɔsɛkye anwoɔnaen ne, ná Awurade kyẽa ne, balɛ́ ye honhom ne ngoa.<verse eid="1CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Ɛhe bɔ ɛmɔfa bɛhoɔhoa ɛmɔ nwo ne de, ɔttemaye. Ɛmɔnze kyɛ yiste kaa bie yeɛ ɔmaa mɔle namukoraati nu ka<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Tu.”</char></note> ɔ? <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Ɛmɔye yiste daa ne bɛfi ɛmɔ nu, na wamaa ɛmɔ ayɛ mɔle foforɛ bɔ enu nga ɔ. Ofikyɛ bafa Kristo bɔ ɔte yɛ Pɛnu boan ne babɔ afɔleɛ dada. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Yeti nnɛmɔ maa yɛfa yiste, anaa bɔne ne amumuyɛɛ yɛdi afahyɛ ne, mmom ɛmɔma yɛfa paanoo bɔ yiste nne nu, bɔ yeɛ ole adwene bɔ enu te, ɔne nahorɛlilɛ yɛli.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Krataa bɔ nni moa ndworɔ mmerɛle ɛmɔ nanu ne, nga ngyirele ɛmɔ kyɛ, nnɛmɔfa bɛ bɔ bɛbɔ adwaman ne adamvoa. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Nakoso nná wiase nanufoɛ bɔ bɛbɔ adwaman, bɛ nye boro nikye, bɛbɔ apoo, anaa bɛsõ bosoen yeɛ né menwa ɛmɔhwe ɛmɔ nwo bɛfi bɛ nwo hɔ oo. Sɛ sɔ a, ahaa sana ɛmɔfi wiase nanu. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Kesaalae de, bɔ metworɔ mebrɛ ɛmɔ yeɛ ole kyɛ, sɛ ebie te aliemaa, ná ɔte adwamammɔfoɛ, ye nye boro nikye,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɔte adufum; Okuro adufudeɛ.”</char></note> ɔsõ bosoen, ɔbɔ amanvoɛ alapaa, ɔte kɔwenzaniɛ, anaa ɔbɔ apoo a, ɛmɔne ye pɛ adamvoa nu.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nnɛmɔfa ye adamvoa.”</char></note> Sɔ sona ne, nnɛmɔ ne ye didi po. <verse eid="1CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Bɛ bɔ benne asafo nanu ne, nzuati yeɛ odikyɛ mebu bɛ atɛn ɔ? Nná bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ nu ne yeɛ odikyɛ mebu bɛ atɛn ɔ, <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />na Nyameɛ koso abu bɛ bɔ benne nu né atɛn? “Ɛmɔye ɔbɔnefoɛ bɛfi ɛmɔ nu.”<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Sɛ ɛmɔ nu bie ne oliema nya edwirɛ a, nzuati yeɛ ɔfa ye kɔ kɔɔto, wɔ bɛ bɔ bɛndengyɛ ne nyunu, na ɔmva ye ngɔ akrongronfoɛ ne nyunu ɔ? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Anaa ɛmɔnze kyɛ akrongronfoɛ nemɔ yeɛ bɛkobu wiase ne atɛn ɔ? Na sɛ ɛmɔ yeɛ ɛmɔkobu wiase né atɛn a, edwirɛ mmaa-mmaa hemɔ yeɛ ɛmɔngora ye di ɔ? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Anaa ɛmɔnze kyɛ, yɛ yeɛ yɛkobu abɔfo atɛn ɔ? Ye de, nzuati yeɛ yɛngora yɛnni asetena nu dwirɛ ɔ? <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Na sɛ ɛmɔnya asetena nu dwirɛ bie a, mmenia bɔ asafo ne mmu bɛ ne, bɛ yeɛ ɛmɔfa bɛkɔ bɛ berɛ kyɛ bɛli ɔ? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Ɛhe de, meka maa ɛmɔ fɛle. Yeti nyanzaniɛ komapɛ po nne ɛmɔ nu bɔ ɔkɔhora kosiesie aliemaa mɔ afia dwirɛ ɔ? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Bɔ yeti, aliemaa kora fa oliema kɔ kɔɔto, bɛ bɔ bɛlle gyidie ne nyunu ne!<verse eid="1CO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Nahorɛ dwirɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ, kɔɔto bɔ ɛmɔfa ɛmɔ nwo bɛkɔ ne kyire kyɛ ɛmɔ ali nguguo. Ye de, nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔmma bɛnyɛ ɛmɔ bɔne ɔ? Na nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔmma bɛnzisi ɛmɔ mmom ɔ? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Ɛmɔ mmom yeɛ ɛmɔyɛ mmenia bɔne, na ɛmɔ sisi bɛ ɔ; ná ɛmɔmva bɛnyɛ ebiala kyɛ ɛmɔ aliemaa mɔ.<verse eid="1CO 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Anaa ɛmɔnze kyɛ abɔnefoɛ nngɔhɔ Nyameɛ Ahennie nanu? Nnɛmɔ maa bɛlaka-laka ɛmɔ: adwamammɔfoɛ, bɛ bɔ bɛsõ bosoen, bɛ bɔ bɛsɛkye agyaa, mmrienzua bɔ bɛmaa mmrienzua ne bɛ da, mmrienzua bɔ bɛne mmrienzua da, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />awiefoɛ, bɛ bɔ bɛ nye boro nikye,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bɛ bɔ bɛkuro adufudeɛ.”</char></note> akɔwenzafoɛ, bɛ bɔ bɛbɔ amanvoɛ alapaa, ɔne bɛ bɔ bɛbɔ apoo nngɔhɔ Nyameɛ Ahennie nanu. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Sɔ yeɛ né ɛmɔ nu biemɔ te ɔ, nakoso banwunzi<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Babia ɛmɔ.”</char></note> ɛmɔ nwo kama, bate ɛmɔ nwo, na babu ɛmɔ kyɛ ɛmɔte teneneefoɛ wɔ y'Awurade Yesu Kristo dumaa nu, ɔne yɛ Nyameɛ honhom nu.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />Nne ye nwo atee kyɛ meyɛ nikye biala, nakoso, nná ye mukoraati yeɛ mvasoɛ wɔ so ɔ. Nne ye nwo atee kyɛ meyɛ nikye biala, nakoso mengɔma nikye fee ngɔfa me nngɔyɛ akoaa. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />Koɛ ti yeɛ aleɛ wɔ berɛ ɔ, na aleɛ ti yeɛ koɛ wɔ berɛ ɔ, nakoso Nyameɛ kɔsɛkye ye munyɔ namu. Nná adwaman ti yeɛ nipadua ne wɔ berɛ ɔ, mmom nipadua ne wɔ berɛ ma Awurade, na Awurade koso wɔ berɛ ma nipadua ne. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Nyameɛ fale ye tumi tingyele Awurade fili ewue nu, na okotingye yɛ koso.<verse eid="1CO 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Ɛmɔnze kyɛ ɛmɔ nipadua ne te Kristo akwaa? Mva Kristo akwaa ne mmata tuutuuniɛ nwo anaa? Nyameɛ pa gua! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Anaa ɛmɔnze kyɛ, ebiala bɔ ɔkɔfa ye nwo kɔbata tuutuuniɛ ne, ɔne ye ayɛ kõ? Ofikyɛ bahworɔ kyɛ, “Bɛ munyɔ ne ayɛ anwoɔnaen kõ.” <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Nakoso, bɔ ɔfa ye nwo bata Awurade ne, ɔne ye ayɛ kõ wɔ honhom nu. <verse eid="1CO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Ɛmɔnwati bɛfi adwamammɔ nwo. Bɔne biala bɔ sona kɔyɛ ne, ɔnne ye nipadua nanu, nakoso bɔ ɔbɔ adwaman ne de, ɔyɛ bɔne tia ye bɔbɔ ye nipadua ne. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Anaa ɛmɔnze kyɛ ɛmɔ nipadua ne te honhom krongron bɔ Nyameɛ afa ama ɛmɔ, bɔ ɔwɔ ɛmɔ nu né asɔre awuro? Afei koso, ɛmɔlle ɛmɔ nwo, ɛmɔte Nyameɛ deɛ, <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />ofikyɛ ɔtɔle ɛmɔ nyɔboɛ serɛ. Yeti, ɛmɔfa ɛmɔ nipadua ne bɛhyɛ Nyameɛ anuonyam.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Afei krataa bɔ ɛmɔ hworɔ bɛbrɛle me ne, ɛhe yeɛ meka mefa ye nwo ɔ: Ɔte pa kyɛ ahaa brienzua ngɔfa ye nwo ngɔha brasua. <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Nakoso, adwaman bɔ wabuso nati, odikyɛ brienzua biala nya ɔye deɛ, na brasua biala koso nya ohu deɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Odikyɛ brienzua yɛ bɔ ɔfata ma ɔye, na brasua ne koso yɛ sɔ ala ma ohu. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Brasua de, olle ye bɔbɔ ye nipadua so tumi, mmom ohu. Sɔ ala yeɛ brienzua koso lle ye nipadua so tumi, na mmom ɔye. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Nnɛmaa ɛmɔ nu biala ka kyɛ ɔne ye mmango ngɔla, sana ɛmɔ munyɔ ne de to nu kyɛ, ɔkwaadwu mmerɛ bie de, ɛmɔngɔla, ná wamaa ɛmɔ anya mmerɛ babɔ mbaeɛ; na ye si ne, ɛmɔ asa bayia nu bieku. Ná wanyɛ kyɛ, ɛmɔ nwo so bɔ ɛmɔ anhyɛ nati, Abɔnzam sɔ ɛmɔ nea. <verse eid="1CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Ɛhe de, ɔtte mmeraa yeɛ mehyɛ mema ɛmɔ ɔ, mmom ɛmɔkuro a, ɛmɔ kɔhora bɛkɔyɛ sɔ. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Ɔhale me ngome a, ahaa sona biala te kyɛ me. Nakoso ebiala le akyɛdeɛ bɔ Nyameɛ afa ama ye ɔ, ebie deɛ te sɔa, yeɛ ebie koso deɛ te sɔa.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Afei asigyafoɛ ne akunafoɛ de, meka mekyire bɛ kyɛ, ɔte pa kyɛ ahaa bɛkɔtena berɛ kyɛbɔ nde ye. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Nakoso sɛ bɛngɔhora bɛngɔhyɛ bɛ nwo so a, ye de bɛgya. Ofikyɛ ɔte pa kyɛ bɛkogya tra kyɛ bɛkɔtena berɛ maa akɔnnɔ kɔhyɛ bɛ so ɔ.<verse eid="1CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Bɛ bɔ bagya ne de, mema bɛ ahyɛdeɛ, nakoso nná me yeɛ mefa mema bɛ ɔ, mmom Awurade. Yeɛ ole kyɛ, nnɛmaa brasua ne ohu tete nu. <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />Na sɛ ɔne ye tete nu po a, nnɛmaa ogya sona foforɛ. Sɛ ɔpena kyɛ ogya a, ɔne ohu ne ha bɔnu bieku. Na brienzua koso, nnɛmaa oyira ɔye.<verse eid="1CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Na bɛ bɔ baha ne de, ɛhe yeɛ meka mekyire ɛmɔ ɔ. Ɛhe de, offi Awurade berɛ. Yeɛ ole kyɛ, sɛ aliemaa bie gya braa bɔ ɔtte gyidiniɛ, na brasua ne de to nu kyɛ ɔne ye kɔtena a, nnɛmaa oyira ye. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Na sɛ brasua bie koso gya biaa bɔ ɔtte gyidiniɛ, na sɛ brienzua ne de to nu kyɛ ɔne ye kɔtena a, nnɛmaa oyira ye. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Ofikyɛ brienzua bɔ ɔtte gyidiniɛ ne, ɔye ti, ye nwo ate; na brasua bɔ ɔtte gyidiniɛ ne koso, ohu ti, ye nwo ate. Wanyɛ sɔ a, ɛmɔ mmaa nemɔ nwo ngɔte, nakoso kesaalae de, bɛ nwo ate. <verse eid="1CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Nakoso, sɛ bɔ ɔtte gyidiniɛ ne pena kyɛ oyira a, ma ɔhɔ. Ɔba sɔ a, mmeraa biala ngyekye brienzua anaa brasua bɔ ɔte gyidiniɛ ne. Asomdwie nu yeɛ Nyameɛ frɛlɛ ɛmɔ ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Brasua, ɛkɔyɛ sɛɛ na anwu kyɛ, wɔ yeɛ ekole ɛhu ngoa ɔ? Na brienzua koso, ɛkɔyɛ sɛɛ na anwu kyɛ wɔ yeɛ ekole ɛye ngoa ɔ?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Ye mukoraati si ne, bɔ Awurade afa ama ebiala ne, sɔ ala yeɛ ebiala bɔ ye bra ɔ, kyɛbɔ Nyameɛ frɛle ye ne. Akwankyerɛ he ala yeɛ mva mmane asafo bɔ waha nemɔ ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Mmerɛ bɔ bɛfrɛle ebie ne, né wapɛ ye toa hɔ? Nnɛmaa ɔha ye nwo kɔsesa ye. Na bɛfrɛle ebie ne, né ɔpɛlle ye toa koso a, nnɛmaa ɔkɔpɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Ofikyɛ sɛ apɛ wɔ toa oo, sɛ ɛpɛlle oo, ɛhene nwo nhia, mmom bɔ ohia yeɛ ole kyɛ ekoli Nyameɛ mmeraa so. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Tebea bɔ ne ebiala wɔ nu, mmerɛ bɔ bɛfrɛle ye ne, ɛhene yeɛ ɔhɔ so tena nu ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Aso bɛfrɛle wɔ ne, né ɛte akoaa? Nnɛmaa ɔha wɔ, nakoso sɛ ɛkɔhora kole wɔ nwo a, fa ye nwo atee ne yɛ sɔ. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Na ebiala bɔ ne ɔte akoaa mmerɛ bɔ Awurade frɛle ye ne, Awurade alɛ́ ye afi ngoasom nu. Sɔ ala yeɛ bɔ né ɔtte akoaa ne koso, waayɛ Kristo akoaa. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Bɛtɔle ɛmɔ nyɔboɛ serɛ, yeti nnɛmaa ɛmɔyɛ ngoaa bɛma mmenia. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Aliemaa mɔ, tebea bɔ ne ebie wɔ nu mmerɛ bɔ Nyameɛ frɛle ye ne, ma ɔhɔ so tena sɔ tebea nanu.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Na mmabunu de, Awurade mmane me ahyɛdeɛ biala kyɛ mva mma bɛ, mmom mekyire m'adwene kyɛ ebie bɔ Awurade anwu ye anwunvo kyɛ ɔyɛ ebie bɔ odi nahorɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Sɛ menea ɔhaw bɔ yɛwɔ nu kesaalae ne a, menwu ye kyɛ ahaa ɔte pa kyɛ sona biala kɔtena berɛ kyɛbɔ ɔte nala. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Agya braa hɔ? Nnɛyɛ w'adwene kyɛ eyira ye. Na sɛ eggya bie koso a, nnɛpena bie. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Nakoso sɛ agya braa po a, ɛyɛlle bɔne. Sɛ ababunu gya a, ɔyɛlle bɔne biala. Nakoso bɛ bɔ bagya ne, bɛ nwo kɔhyere bɛ wɔ anwoɔnaen nu. Me de, mepena kyɛ ɛmɔ nwo tɔ ɛmɔ.<verse eid="1CO 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Aliemaa mɔ, bɔ mekyire yeɛ ole kyɛ, mmerɛ bɔ waha ne te kaa. Yeti ofi ɛnɛ bɔ ɔkɔ ne, bɛ bɔ bagya braa ne, bɛyɛ kyɛ bɛ bɔ bɛgyalle ne, <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />bɛ bɔ bɛsu ne, bɛyɛ kyɛ bɛ bɔ bɛnzu ne, bɛ bɔ bɛ nye agye ne, bɛyɛ kyɛ bɛ bɔ bɛ wora abɔ ne, na odikyɛ bɛ bɔ bɛtɔ ne yɛ bɛ nwo kyɛ bɛ bɔ bɛlle bie ne, <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />ná bɛ bɔ bɛfa ewiase ne bɛdi dwumaa ne koso, nnɛmaa bɛmaa wiase ne di bɛ ti, ofikyɛ kyɛbɔ wiase ne te, ɔsesa. <verse eid="1CO 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Menguro kyɛ adwene-dwene biala hyɛ ɛmɔ so. Brienzua bɔ ogyalle ne de, ɔda dwene Awurade nningyein nwo, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔsɔ Awurade nye ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Nakoso brienzua bɔ wagya ne de, wiase nningyein yeɛ ɔdwene ye nwo ɔ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔsɔ ɔye nye ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />Yeti yenu nu ahyɛ. Sɔ ala yeɛ brasua bɔ ogyalle ne, ɔne ababunu koso dwene Awurade nningyein nwo, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɔkɔyɛ krongron wɔ ye nipadua ne ye honhom nu ɔ. Nakoso brasua bɔ wagya ne de, nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ wiase ne yeɛ ɔdwene ye nwo ɔ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔsɔ ohu nye ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Ɛmɔ ngɔsoɛ ti yeɛ meka ɛhe ɔ, na ɔtte kyɛ mehyɛ ɛmɔ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɛmɔ kɔyɛ bɔ ɔte pa, na ɛmɔ ayere ɛmɔ nwo basõ Awurade bɔ hwee ngɔha ɛmɔ ɔ.<verse eid="1CO 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Nakoso sɛ ebie nwu ye nwo kyɛ agyaa bɔ ogyalle nati, ɔyɛ basabasa, na sɛ sɔ sona ne tte akwalaa a, ye de bɔ odikyɛ ɔyɛ ɛhe: Ma ɔyɛ bɔ okuro ɔ, ɔtte bɔne, ma ogya. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Nakoso sɛ ebie si ye adwene pi, bɔ nikye fee nhyɛ ye, na mmom, ɔkora hyɛ ye nwo so, na wasi gyinayɛ wɔ y'ahone nu kyɛ ɔngogya a, wayɛ nikye. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Bɔ wagya ne koso ayɛ nikye, nakoso bɔ ogyalle ne ayɛ nikye atra bɔ wagya ne.<verse eid="1CO 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Sɛ brasua ahu te ase a, mmeraa akyekye ye abata ohu nanwo. Nakoso sɛ ohu ne wu a, ye de ɔne ye atete nu, ɔkɔhora kogya ebiala bɔ okuro ɔ, nakoso ogya wɔ Awurade nu ngome. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Nakoso me de menwu ye kyɛ, sɛ ɔtena berɛ sɔ ala a, ye nye kɔgye paa. Medɛ́ medi kyɛ me koso, Nyameɛ honhom wɔ me so.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Afei aleɛ bɔ bafa babɔ afɔleɛ bama bosoen ne, bɔ meka mefa ye nwo ɛhe: Yɛse kyɛ yɛ mukoraati yɛle nimdeɛ. Nimdeɛ ma sona ma ye nwo so, nakoso ɔdɔ ma ngɔsoɛ. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Sɛ ebie adwene yɛ ye kyɛ ɔse nikye bie a, ye de, onya nwuni nikye ne yé kyɛbɔ odikyɛ onwu ye ne. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Nakoso sɛ ebie dɔ Nyameɛ a, Nyameɛ se ye.<verse eid="1CO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Na afei sɛ ebie di aleɛ bɔ bafa babɔ afɔleɛ bama bosoen a, yɛse kyɛ bosoen de, ɔtte hwee wɔ wiase he anu, na Nyameɛ komapɛ twen yeɛ ɔwɔ berɛ ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Ɔwɔ nu, nningyein pee yeɛ bɛfrɛ bɛ nyameɛ wɔ anwuro ne aseɛ he aso, kyɛbɔ “nyameɛ” pee ne “awura mɔ” pee wɔ berɛ ne, <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />nakoso yɛ de, Nyameɛ komapɛ yeɛ yɛlɛ ye ɔ, Baba ne bɔ nikye biala fi ye berɛ, na ye ti yeɛ yɛte ase ne. Ná Awurade komapɛ yeɛ ɔwɔ berɛ ɔ, Yesu Kristo, bɔ bɛnate yeso bɛbɔle nikye biala, ná ɔnate ye so yeɛ yɛwɔ berɛ ne.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Nakoso, nná ebiala yeɛ ɔse ɛhe ɔ. Ná ɔbaadwu ɛnɛ, bosoen nwo amaneɛ ne tɛ́ wɔ ebiemɔ adwene ne, yeti sɛ bɛdi sɔ aleɛ nemɔ bie a, b'adwene yɛ bɛ kyɛ bali aleɛ bɔ bafa bama bosoen. Na ɔnate kyɛ b'ahonim yɛ mmerɛ nati, ogua ye nwo fiɛ. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Nakoso, nná aleɛ yeɛ ɔmaa yɛpingye Nyameɛ ɔ; sɛ yanni a, yɛnhwere hwee, yeɛ sɛ yɛdi koso a, yɛnnya ngɔsoɛ biala. <verse eid="1CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Nakoso ɛmɔnea yé na ahofadie bɔ ɛmɔle ye ne, wando bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ mmerɛ ne sintidua. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Ofikyɛ sɛ ebie bɔ ye ahonim yɛ mmerɛ nwu wɔ bɔ ele nimdeɛ ne kyɛ ɛte bosoen sua nu edidi a, aso ɛhene ngɔha ye maa ongoli aleɛ bɔ bafa babɔ afɔleɛ bama bosoen? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Yeti wɔ nimdeɛ nati, odikyɛ eliema bɔ ɔyɛ mmerɛ ne sɛkye anaa? Eliema bɔ Kristo wu mane ye ne! <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Sɛ ɛmɔyɛ bɔne sɔa betia bɛ liema mɔ, na ɛmɔpira bɛ ahonim bɔ ɔyɛ mmerɛ ne a, né ɛmɔyɛ bɔne betia Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Yeti, sɛ aleɛ bɔ ngoli ne kɔto nniema sintidua a, ye de mengoli naen koraa, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a mengɔto nniema sintidua ɔ.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Aso nne ye nwo atee kyɛ meyɛ bɔ mekuro biala hɔ? Aso nnde somafoɛ? Na nnwuni y'Awurade Yesu hɔ? Na nná ɛmɔ yeɛ ɛmɔte me sa noa adwuma wɔ Awurade nu ɔ? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Sɛ ebiemɔ nnwu me kyɛ nde somafoɛ po a, ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔnwu me kyɛ nde somafoɛ! Na nikye bɔ ɔhyɛ me nzorɛ kyɛ nde Awurade somafoɛ yeɛ ole ɛmɔ.<verse eid="1CO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Bɛbɔ bɛneɛnea me dwirɛ nu ne, ɛhe yeɛ mefa meye me noa ɔ: <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Yɛlle ye nwo ate kyɛ yɛdidi ná yɛno anaa? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Ná yɛlle ye nwo atee kyɛ yɛgya mmrasua bɔ bɛte gyidifoɛ, na yɛfa bɛ yɛdi yɛ si kyɛbɔ asomafoɛ bɔ baha, Awurade aliemaa nemɔ, ne Kefa<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ye ala yeɛ bɛfrɛ ye Petro ne.</char></note> yɛ ne anaa? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Anaa mene Barnaba ngome de, adwuma bɔ yɛyɛ yɛnea yɛ nwo ne, yɛyakyi a onyɛ yé? <verse eid="1CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Sogyaniɛ beni yeɛ ye bɔbɔ otua ye nwo kerɛ ɔ? Na nwa yeɛ ɔyɛ bobe boo a, onni nu mmaa ɔ? Anaa nwa yeɛ ɔnea ngaka bɔ onno bɛ nyɔfonesue ne bie ɔ?<verse eid="1CO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Sona adwene yeɛ mefa meka ɛhe hɔ? Nná sɔ ala yeɛ mmeraa ne koso ka ɔ? <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Bahworɔ ye wɔ Mose mmeraa nanu kyɛ: “Nnɛkyekye nandwie noa, mmerɛ bɔ ɔporo hwiit ne.” Aso nandwie ne yeɛ Nyameɛ dwene ye nwo ɔ? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Anaa yɛ ti yeɛ ɔhane sɔ dwirɛ ne? Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, yɛ ti yeɛ ɔmaa bɛhworɔle sɔ dwirɛ ne. Ofikyɛ bɔ ofundam aseɛ ne bɔ ɔboro atokoɔ ne, mmerɛ bɔ bɛyɛ sɔ ne, odikyɛ benya anidasoɛ kyɛ bekonya bɛ kyɛfa. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Yeti, sɛ yalua honhom nu mmaa wɔ ɛmɔ nu, na sɛ yɛpɛ anwoɔnaen nu nningyein yɛfi ɛmɔ berɛ a, ɔbo so anaa? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Sɛ ebiemɔ kora dɛ́ nningyein bɔ ɔte sɔ fi ɛmɔ berɛ a, yɛ de, yɛlle ye nwo atee bɔ ɔtra sɔ anaa? Nakoso, yɛ de, yamva ye nwo atee bɔ ɔte sɔ ne yanyɛ adwuma, mmom yɛbɔle mmɔden yɛgyinane ɔhaw biala noa, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a yɛngosi Kristo nzɛmba ne atee. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Bɛbɔ bɛyɛ adwuma krongron wɔ asɔre awuro berɛ ne, ɛmɔnze kyɛ bɛdi ɛberɛ aleɛ ne bie? Na ɛmɔnze kyɛ bɛbɔ bɛyɛ adwuma daa wɔ afɔleɛ bokyea nanwo ne nya nningyein bɔ bɛfa bɛbɔ afɔleɛ ne bie? <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Sɔ ala yeɛ Awurade ahyɛ mmeraa kyɛ, bɛbɔ bɛka nzɛmba ne, bɛfa nzɛmba naso bɛtena ase.<verse eid="1CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Nakoso sɔ nhyehyɛɛ ne, mmvale enu komapɛ po nnyɛle adwuma, yeɛ nná nningyein bɔ ngonya ngofi ɛmɔ berɛ nati yeɛ metworɔ ɛhe ɔ. Ahaa ye de ɔte pa kyɛ ngowu tra kyɛ ngɔmaa ebie kole bɔ mefa mehoɔhoa me nwo ne kofi me sa nu ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Sɛ meka nzɛmba ne a, ɛhene ngyire kyɛ mva nhoɔhoa me nwo, ofikyɛ ɔte adwuma bɔ odikyɛ meyɛ ɔ. Na sɛ manga nzɛmba ne a, me yaakɔ! <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Sɛ mefia me kunu meyɛ a, ngonya ye nwo akatua, nakoso sɛ offi m'ahone nu po a, ɔte adwuma bɔ bafa bawura me sa ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Ye de, akatua beni yeɛ ngonya ye ɔ? Yeɛ ole kyɛ ngɔfa nzɛmba ne ngɔma mbaen, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ye nwo atee bɔ nne ye ne, mengɔfa mengɔyɛ bɔ ɔttemaye ɔ.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Ɔwɔ nu, nnwura ebiala bo, nakoso mayɛ me nwo akoaa mama ebiala, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ngonya mmeni pee. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Nyɛle me nwo Yudaniɛ mmane Yudafoɛ, ná wamaa manya Yudafoɛ. Bɛbɔ bɛwura mmeraa bo ne, nyɛle me nwo kyɛ ebie bɔ owura mmeraa bo, ná wamaa manya bɛ. Ɔwɔ nu, me bɔbɔ de nnwura mmeraa bo. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Bɛbɔ benne mmeraa bo ne, nyɛle me nwo kyɛ ebie bɔ ɔnne mmeraa bo, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ngonya bɛ ɔ. Ɛhene ngyire kyɛ nne mmeraa bo wɔ Nyameɛ nu oo, nwura Kristo mmeraa nabo. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Bɛbɔ bayɛ mmerɛ ne, nyɛle mmerɛ mmane bɛ, ná wamaa manya bɛ. Mayɛ bɔ ngɔhora biala mama mmenia ahoroɛ mukoraati, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, atee biala so ne, ngole bɛ nu biemɔ ngoa. <verse eid="1CO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Nzɛmba nati yeɛ mayɛ ɛhemɔ mukoraati ne, na wamaa manya nu kyɛfa.<verse eid="1CO 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Nnaa ɛmɔse kyɛ sɛ besi akan a, bɛbɔ bɛtu mirika namukoraati tu bie, nakoso komapɛ yeɛ bɛbɔ ye aba so ɔ? Sɔ ala yeɛ ɛmɔtu mirika ne ɔ, ná wamaa ɛmɔ sa aha abasobɔdeɛ ne. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Ebiala bɔ osi akan ne hyɛ ye nwo so wɔ nikye biala nu, bɛyɛ sɔ kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a bekonya abasobɔdeɛ bɔ ɔsɛkye, nakoso yɛ de, yekonya abasobɔdeɛ bɔ ɔnzɛkye. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Yeti, me de, mendu mirika ne biala-biala; na twɔleɛ bɔ metoto ne, mendo ye kyɛ ebie bɔ ɔbo mvrama ne. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />Ɛhene ati, meyɛ me nipadua ne aborɛ,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Medi me nipadua ne nya.”</char></note> na mehyɛ ye kyɛ akoaa, ná wamma manyɛ ebie bɔ atee bie so ne ɔmvata, mmerɛ bɔ maha nzɛmba mahyire afoforɛ ne.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Aliemaa mɔ, mepena kyɛ ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ, né yɛ nana mɔ wura munungum nabo, na bɛ mukoraati bɛfale ɛpo nanu. <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Yeti bɛbɔle bɛ mukoraati asu wɔ Mose nu, wɔ munungum ne ɛpo nanu, <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />bɛ mukoraati bɛlili honhom nu aleɛ kõ, <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />na bɛnone honhom nu nzue kõ. Benyane sɔ nzue ne bɛfili honhom nu nyɔboɛ bɔ ne oli bɛ si nanu, na sɔ nyɔboɛ ne yeɛ ole Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Nakoso, Nyameɛ nye angye bɔ bɛ nu pee yɛle nanwo, yeti ɛserɛ naso yeɛ bɛwuli ɔ.<verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Na sɔ dwirɛ hemɔ ayɛ kɔkɔbɔ ama yɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, yɛ nye ngɔgye bɔne nwo, kyɛbɔ bɛ nye gyele ye nwo ne. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />Yeti, nnɛmɔ sõ bosoen kyɛbɔ bɛ nu biemɔ yɛle ne. Bahworɔ kyɛ: “Mmenia ne tenane ase didili, na bɛnone, na bɛdwɔso bɛgyele bɛ nye.” <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Ná nnɛmɔ maa yɛbɔ adwaman, kyɛbɔ bɛ nu biemɔ bɔle adwaman maa ɛlɛhomapɛ mmenia 23,000 wuli ne. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Yeɛ nnɛmɔ maa yɛsɔ Awurade yɛnea, kyɛbɔ bɛ nu biemɔ sɔle ye neane maa ɛwoo huhuni bɛ ne. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Afei koso, nnɛmɔ nwiinwii, kyɛbɔ bɛ nu biemɔ nwiinwiini maa abɔfo ne sɛkyele bɛ ne. <verse eid="1CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Bɔ ɔtole bɛ namukoraati te kɔkɔbɔ, na bahworɔ bato berɛ kyɛ ɔbɔ yɛ bɔ wiase awieɛ ne ato yɛ ne kɔkɔ. <verse eid="1CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Yeti, ebiala bɔ y'adwene yɛ ye kyɛ ogyi berɛ ne, ɔnea yé na wamvi ase. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Nzɔhwɛ biala bɔ ɔkɔto ɛmɔ ne, ɔtte nikye bɔ sona nnwuni bie lle ɔ. Nyameɛ te ebie bɔ odi nahorɛ, yeti ɔngɔma nzɔhwɛ bɔ ɔbo ɛmɔ anwoserɛ so ngɔto ɛmɔ. Mmom ɔkɔmaa atee kɔla nzɔhwɛ nanwo, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɛmɔ kofi nu, na ɛmɔ ahora bagyina ye noa.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Yeti nniema mɔ, ɛmɔhwe ɛmɔ nwo bɛfi abosonsom nwo. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Me dwudwo mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ mmenia bɔ bɛse nworɛ, yeti ɛmɔdwene bɔ meka nanwo. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Nhyira kwangoa bɔ yɛhyira so ne, ɛhene ngyire kyɛ yanya Kristo mogya nanu kyɛfa anaa? Na paanoo bɔ yɛbubu nu ne, ɛhene ngyire kyɛ yanya Kristo nipadua nanu kyɛfa anaa? <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Ɔwɔ nu kyɛ yɛsone, nakoso paanoo ne bɔ ɔte komapɛ nati, yɛ mukoraati yɛte nipadua kõ, ofikyɛ yɛdi paanoo kõ ne bie. <verse eid="1CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Ɛmɔnea Israelfoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ne, bɛbɔ bɛdi afɔleɛ ne bie ne, nnaa bɛne afɔleɛ bokyea ne yeɛ ɛkyɛ ɔ? <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Nzu koraa yeɛ mepena mekyire ye? Aso bɔ mekyire yeɛ ole kyɛ, aleɛ bɔ bɛfa bɛbɔ afɔleɛ bɛma bosoen ne te nikye bie, anaa bosoen ne te nikye bie hɔ? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Daabi oo, mmom afɔleɛ bɔ maen-maen ne bɔ ne, bɛbɔ bɛma adaemone,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Sunzummɔne.”</char></note> ɔtte Nyameɛ. Ná membena kyɛ ɛmɔ ne adaemone nya abusuabɔ biala. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Ɛmɔ ngɔhora bɛngɔno Awurade kwangoa noa, ná ɛmɔ asa bano adaemone kwangoa noa; na ɛmɔ ngɔhora bɛngɔdidi Awurade tɛbulu so, na ɛmɔ asa badidi adaemone tɛbulu so. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Anaa yɛpena kyɛ yɛhyɛ Nyameɛ apue? Yɛ nwo yɛ se tra ye hɔ?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />Yɛle ye nwo atee kyɛ yɛyɛ nikye biala, nakoso nná ye mukoraati yeɛ mvasoɛ wɔ so ɔ. Yɛle ye nwo atee kyɛ yɛyɛ nikye biala, nakoso nná ye mukoraati yeɛ ɔmaa yɛnya ngɔsoɛ ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Nnɛmaa ebiala pena bɔ ɔte pa ma ye nwo ngome, mmom ɔpena bɔ ɔkɔboka afoforɛ koso. <verse eid="1CO 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Ɛmɔli naen biala bɔ bɛtɔne ye dwaaso ne, nakoso ɛmɔ ahonim ti, nnɛmɔ bisa-bisa ye nwo dwirɛ, <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />ofikyɛ “aseɛ ne, ɔne nikye biala bɔ ɔwɔ nu ne te Awurade deɛ.” <verse eid="1CO 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Sɛ ebie bɔ ɔtte gyidiniɛ to asaa frɛ ɛmɔ, na sɛ ɛmɔkɔ a,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Na sɛ ɛmɔpena kyɛ ɛmɔkɔ a.”</char></note> bɔ ɔkɔfa kosie ɛmɔ nyunu biala, ɛmɔli, ná ɛmɔ ahonim ti, nnɛmɔ bisa ye nwo dwirɛ biala. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Nakoso sɛ ebie ka kyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, “Bafa aleɛ he babɔ afɔleɛ bama bosoen” a, sona bɔ ɔha hyirele ɛmɔ ne, ɔne ahonim ti, nnɛmɔ di. <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />Nná ɛmɔ ahonim deɛ nwo dwirɛ yeɛ meka hɔ oo, mmom sona ne deɛ. Na nzuati yeɛ odikyɛ ebie fa ye ahonim kyire me bɔ nyɛ ɔ? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Na sɛ mefa asennaa medi a, nzuati yeɛ odikyɛ bɛdwudwo betia me wɔ nikye bɔ mala ye nwo ase nanwo ɔ?<verse eid="1CO 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Yeti sɛ ɛmɔdidi oo, ɛmɔ no oo, anaa ɛmɔyɛ nikye foforɛ biala oo, ɛmɔyɛ ye mukoraati bɛhyɛ Nyameɛ anuonyam. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Na ɛmɔnea yé na ɛmɔ ando Yudafoɛ, Greekfoɛ, anaa Nyameɛ asafo ne sintidua, <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />kyɛbɔ mebɔ mmɔden kyɛ ngɔyɛ bɔ ɔsɔ ebiala nye ne. Nná bɔ ohia me ngome yeɛ mepena ɔ, mmom mepena bɔ ohia mmeni pee kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a bekonya ngoa ɔ.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Ɛmɔsuesua me, kyɛbɔ nzuesuane Kristo ne.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Aliemaa mɔ, me kamvo ɛmɔ, ofikyɛ ɛmɔkaye me wɔ nikye biala nu, na ngyerɛkyerɛ bɔ mva mmane ɛmɔ ne koso, ɛmɔdi so pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Nakoso, mepena kyɛ ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ, brienzua biala ti yeɛ ole Kristo, brasua biala ti yeɛ ole brienzua, na Kristo koso ti yeɛ ole Nyameɛ. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Brienzua biala bɔ ɔbɔ mbaeɛ anaa ɔhyɛ ngɔm a, ɔkɔkata ye ti so ne, wagua ye ti ne nyunu ase. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Na brasua biala bɔ ɔbɔ mbaeɛ anaa ɔhyɛ ngɔm a, ɔngata ye ti so ne, wagua ye ti ne nyunu ase, ofikyɛ ɔte kyɛ wabɔ sakola<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Wapra ye ti.”</char></note> nala. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Sɛ brasua angata ye ti so a, ye de ma ɔpra ye ti nwiaa ne. Na sɛ ɔyɛ fɛle kyɛ brasua kɔpra ye ti de a, ma ɔkata so. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Brienzua de nnɛmaa ɔkata ye ti so, ofikyɛ ɔte Nyameɛ suban ne ye anuonyam; nakoso brasua de, ɔte brienzua anuonyam. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />Ofikyɛ nná brasua nu yeɛ brienzua fi ɔ, brasua mmom yeɛ ofi brienzua nu ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Yeɛ nná brasua ti yeɛ bɛbɔle brienzua ɔ, mmom brienzua ti yeɛ bɛbɔle brasua ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Ɛhe ne abɔfo nemɔ ti yeɛ odikyɛ brasua nya nikye bie wɔ yeti so bɔ okyire kyɛ ɔbrɛ ye nwo ase wura tumi ne bo. <verse eid="1CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Awurade nyunu de, brienzua ngɔ nyakyi brasua, yeɛ brasua koso ngɔ nyakyi brienzua, <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />na kyɛbɔ brasua fi brienzua nu ne, sɔ ala yeɛ brasua wo brienzua ɔ. Na nikye biala fi Nyameɛ berɛ. <verse eid="1CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Ɛmɔ bɔbɔ ɛmɔbu ye nwo atɛn: Ɛmɔnea a, ɔte pa kyɛ brasua kɔbɔ Nyameɛ mbaeɛ bɔ ɔngɔ kata ye ti so ɔ? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Sɛ ɛmɔnea kyɛbɔ bɛbɔle nningyein ne a, sɛ brienzua yakyi ye ti nwiaa gua ye nwo kusuu a, ɛmɔnnwu ye kyɛ ɔte animguaseɛ ne? <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />Nakoso brasua de, sɛ ye ti nwiaa gua ye nwo a, ɛmɔnnwu ye kyɛ ɔhyɛ ye anuonyam ne? Ofikyɛ bafa nwiaa ne bama ye kyɛ ɔfa kata ye ti so. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Sɛ ebie nne sɔ dwirɛ hemɔ ndonu a, yɛlle nhyehyɛɛ foforɛ biala kõ, Nyameɛ asafo nemɔ koso, bɛlle kõ.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Edwirɛ he bɔ meka ne de, mengɔkamvo ɛmɔ, ofikyɛ sɛ ɛmɔyia nu a, ɛmɔnyɛ nikye pa, bɔ ɔttemaye yeɛ ɛmɔyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Bɔ oli moa ne, mate kyɛ sɛ ɛmɔyia nu kyɛ asafo a, ɛyɛ a né mbakye-mbakye-muɛ wɔ ɛmɔ nu, na atee bie so ne, medɛ́ medi. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Ofikyɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔte biala ne ngyekyɛmue kɔwa ɛmɔ nu, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bekonwu bɛbɔ bɛfata ne. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Sɛ ɛmɔyia nu a, menne menni kyɛ Awurade Adidie<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Awurade Nnɔsoa Aleɛ.”</char></note> yeɛ ɛmɔdi ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />Ofikyɛ mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔ baali ne, né ebiala ali moa ali ye nnɔsoa aleɛ deɛ. Yeti, ɛhɔen ku ebie ne, ne ebie koso abo. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Aso ɛmɔ nu biala lle awuro bɔ odidi nu na ɔno nu anaa? Anaa ɛmɔbu Nyameɛ asafo ne animtia, ná ɛmɔgua bɛbɔ bɛlle hwee ne nyunu ase hɔ? Nzu yeɛ nga ngyire ɛmɔ ɔ? Ngamvo ɛmɔ anaa? Ɛhe anwo de, mengɔkamvo ɛmɔ!<verse eid="1CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Bɔ nya mvili Awurade berɛ nala yeɛ me koso mva mmane ɛmɔ ne. Yeɛ ole kyɛ, kɔngɔen bɔ bɛbaaye Awurade Yesu bɛma ne, ɔfale paanoo <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />na ɔlale ase yiele ne, obubule nu, yeɛ ɔhane kyɛ, “Ɛhe gyi berɛ ma me nipadua bɔ bɛfa bɛma ɛmɔ ne, ɛmɔhɔ so bɛyɛ ɛhe bɛfa bɛkaye me.” <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Sɔ ala yeɛ ɔyɛle kwangoa ne, mmerɛ bɔ bɛdidi bɛyiele ne, ɔfale kwangoa ne, na ɔhane kyɛ, “Sɔ kwangoa he gyi berɛ ma apam foforɛ bɔ bɛfa me mogya bɛyɛ ne. Mmerɛ biala bɔ ɛmɔ kɔno kwangoa he noa ne, ɛmɔyɛ bɛfa bɛkaye me.” <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Na mmerɛ biala bɔ ɛmɔ koli paanoo he, na ɛmɔ kɔno kwangoa he noa ne, né ɛmɔka Awurade wue nanwo dwirɛ kodwu kyɛ ɔkɔwa ɔ.<verse eid="1CO 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Yeti sona biala bɔ okoli paanoo he, anaakyɛ ɔkɔno Awurade kwangoa ne noa wɔ atee bɔ ɔttemaye so ne, okoli Awurade nipadua ne ye mogya nanwo fɔ. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Yeti, maa sona ne limoa neɛnea ye nwo nu yé, na ɔnea sɛ ɔfata kora né wali paanoo ne bie, ná wano kwangoa ne noa. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Na ebiala bɔ odi na ɔno bɔ ɔnde Awurade nipadua nabo ne, odi no fa atemmuo ba ye bɔbɔ ye nwo so. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Ɛhene ati yeɛ ɛmɔ nu pee nala ayɛ mmerɛ na bafokyɛ ne, na ɛmɔ nu biemɔ ala wɔ ewue nu ne.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Awuwu ne.”</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Sɛ yɛneɛnea yɛ nwo nu yé a, bɛngɔbu yɛ atɛn. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Nakoso sɛ bɛbu yɛ atɛn a, Awurade yeɛ ɔtengyɛ yɛ so ɔ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛngɔbu yɛ fɔ bɛngɔ boka wiase naso ɔ.<verse eid="1CO 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Yeti nniema mɔ, sɛ ɛmɔyia nu kyɛ ɛmɔ baali a, ɛmɔ nwondɛ ɛmɔ nwo. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Sɛ ɛhɔen ku ebie a, ma odidi awuro, na sɛ ɛmɔ bayia nu a, ɛmɔ amva atemmuo bamma ɛmɔ nwo so. Nningyein bɔ waha ne de, sɛ meba a, ngoli ye mukoraati nwo dwumaa.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Afei aliemaa mɔ, menguro kyɛ honhom nu akyɛdeɛ nanwo dwirɛ fea ɛmɔ. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Ɛmɔse kyɛ mmerɛ bɔ ne ɛmɔte wiasefoɛ ne, bɛlaka-lakale ɛmɔ maa ɛmɔsõne bosoen bɔ bɛndwudwo, na nekaa biala bɔ bɛkɔhɔ ne, né ɛmɔli bɛ si. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Na kesaalae, mepena kyɛ ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ, ebiala nne berɛ bɔ ɔfa Nyameɛ honhom dwudwo a, ɔkɔha kyɛ, “Badome Yesu” ɔ. Na ebiala bɔ ɔkɔhora kɔha kyɛ: “Yesu te Awurade!” ne, honhom krongron wɔ ye so.<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Ɔwɔ nu, akyɛdeɛ ne sone,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Te ahoroɛ pee.”</char></note> nakoso honhom ne te kõ, <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />na ɔsom adwuma ne te ahoroɛ pee, nakoso Awurade komapɛ yeɛ ɔwɔ berɛ ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Na dwumadie ne koso sone, nakoso Nyameɛ komapɛ nala yeɛ ɔyɛ ye mukoraati nwo adwuma wɔ ebiala nu ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Na nikye pa bie ti yeɛ honhom ne ala ye nwo ali wɔ ebiala nu ne. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Honhom ne ma ebie ka edwirɛ bɔ nyanza wɔ nu, ná honhom komapɛ nala amaa ebie anya nimdeɛ, <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />honhom komapɛ ne maa ebie nya gyidie, na honhom nala amaa sona foforɛ koso anya akyɛdeɛ bɔ ɔfa sa anwonyerɛ, <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />na ɔmaa ebie yɛ anwanwadeɛ, ebie hyɛ ngɔm, ebie nwu edwirɛ bɔ ofi honhom nu, ebie ka dwudwolɛ ahoroɛ, yeɛ ebie koso kyire dwudwolɛ ahoroɛ bo. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Dwumadie he mukoraati fi honhom komapɛ nala berɛ, na kyɛbɔ ɔkuro ne, yeɛ wamaa ebiala sa aha ye ɔ.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Na kyɛbɔ nipadua ne te kõ, nakoso ole akwaa pee, ná akwaa ne sone de, nakoso ɔbɔnu yɛ nipadua kõ ne, sɔ ala yeɛ Kristo te ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Na honhom komapɛ yeɛ bɛfa bɛbɔle yɛ mukoraati asu bɛhɔle nipadua komapɛ nu, ɔmva ye nwo kyɛ yɛte Yudaniɛ anaa Greekniɛ, akoaa anaa dehyeɛ ne, na yɛ mukoraati yɛnone honhom kõ.<verse eid="1CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Nná akwaa komapɛ yeɛ ɔyɛ nipadua ne ɔ, mmom ɔsone. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Sɛ ɔkɔba kyɛ agyire ka kyɛ, “Nnde asaa ti, mmoka nipadua naso” a, ɛhene ngyire kyɛ ɔbokka nipadua naso. <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Na sɛ asoɛ ka kyɛ, “Nnde anyeɛ, yeti mmoka nipadua naso” a, ɛhene ngyire kyɛ ɔbokka nipadua naso. <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Sɛ nipadua namukoraati te anyeɛ a, ahaa beni yeɛ yɛkɔfa yɛkɔte edwirɛ ɔ? Na sɛ ye mukoraati te asoɛ a, ahaa beni yeɛ yɛkɔfa yɛkɔte pambaen ɔ? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Nakoso Nyameɛ ahyehyɛ nipadua akwaa namukoraati kyɛbɔ okuro ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Sɛ yɛ mukoraati yɛte akwaa kõ a, ahaa beni yeɛ ole nipadua ne? <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Kyɛbɔ ɔte ne, akwaa ne sone, nakoso nipadua ne te komapɛ. <verse eid="1CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Anyeɛ ngɔhora ngɔha ngohyire asaa kyɛ,“Menhia wɔ.” Na sɔ ala yeɛ tire ngɔhora ngɔha ngohyire agyire kyɛ, “Menhia wɔ.” <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Na mmom bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, nipadua akwaa bɔ wayɛ kyɛ wayɛ mmerɛ ne, ɛhene yeɛ ye nwo hia paa, <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />na akwaa bɔ yɛnwu ye kyɛ onhia nidie ne, ɛhene mmom yeɛ yɛfa nidie yɛma ye paa, na bɔ ɔnyɛ nyemene ne, ɛhene yeɛ yɛmaa yɛ nye kɔ ye nwo paa ɔ, <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />ofikyɛ akwaa bɔ ɔyɛ nyemene ne de, onhia hwee. Nakoso kyɛbɔ Nyameɛ ahyehyɛ nipadua ne, akwaa bɔ yɛmmu ye ne po yeɛ wama ye nidie pee ɔ, <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ngyekyɛmue biala ngɔwa nipadua nanu ɔ, na akwaa biala nwo ahia ye mmango. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Sɛ akwaa kõ nwu amaneɛ a, ɔka bɛ mu; na sɛ bɛhyɛ akwaa kõ anuonyam a, akwaa bɔ waha namukoraati nye gye.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Afei, ɛmɔte Kristo nipadua, na ɛmɔ nu biala te akwaa kõ. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Na Nyameɛ afa adwuma awura ebiemɔ sa wɔ asafo nanu, bɛbɔ bɛlili moa yeɛ ole asomafoɛ ne; bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ te adiifoɛ; bɔ ɔtɔ so nza te akyerɛkyerɛfoɛ; afei bɛbɔ bɛyɛ anwanwadeɛ; ɛhene si ne akyɛdeɛ bɔ bɛfa bɛsa anwonyerɛ; adwuma bɔ bɛyɛ bɛfa bɛboka afoforɛ; kyɛbɔ bɛdi nningyein nyunu, yeɛ bɛbɔ bɛka dwudwolɛ ahoroɛ. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Aso bɛ mukoraati bɛte asomafoɛ? Bɛ mukoraati bɛte adiifoɛ? Bɛ mukoraati bɛte akyerɛkyerɛfoɛ? Anaa bɛ mukoraati bɛyɛ nzɛngyerɛneɛ? <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Aso bɛ nu biala yeɛ ole akyɛdeɛ bɛ bɛfa bɛsa anwonyerɛ ɔ? Bɛ nu biala yeɛ ɔka dwudwolɛ ahoroɛ ɔ? Anaa bɛ nu biala yeɛ okyire dwudwolɛ bo ɔ? <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Ɛmɔyere ɛmɔ nwo bɛpena akyɛdeɛ bɔ ye nwo hia paa nemɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:31">Nakoso ngohyire ɛmɔ atee bɔ ɔte pa paa ne.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Sɛ meka mmenia ne abɔfo dwudwolɛ, ná sɛ nnne dɔ a, nde kyɛ dɔn anaa akasaa bie bɔ ɔyɛ dede mbaen ne. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Sɛ nne ngɔmhyɛ akyɛdeɛ, mete edwirɛ krongron bɔ wafea ne nimdeɛ biala bo, nne gyidie bɔ okora tutu mmokaa, na sɛ nnne ɔdɔ a, nnde hwee. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Sɛ metɔne bɔ nne ye biala mefa metɔ aleɛ mema ahiafoɛ, na mefa me nipadua mebɔ afɔleɛ mefa mehoɔhoa me nwo, nakoso nnne ɔdɔ a, mengonya mvasoɛ biala wɔ so.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Ɔdɔ le aboterɛ, na ye ti anu nnyɛ se. Ɔdɔ de, ɔtte ahoɔyaa, ɔndwa ye noanu,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɔhoɔhoa ye nwo.”</char></note> na ɔmma ye nwo so. <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />Ɔdɔ nnyɛ nikye bɔ ɔttemaye, nná bɔ ohia ye ngome yeɛ ɔdwene ye nwo ɔ, ɔmvɛ yaa ndɛ, na ɔmva bɔne nwura ye nu. <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />Ɔdɔ nni ahurusi wɔ nikye bɔ ɔttemaye nwo, mmom nahorɛ yeɛ odi ye nwo ahurusi ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />Ɔdɔ to ye bo ase wɔ nikye biala nu, ole nikye biala nu gyidie, ole nikye biala nu anidasoɛ, na ɔfa animia gyina nikye biala nu.<verse eid="1CO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Ɔdɔ bo mbɛ lle. Nakoso, sɛ ngɔmhyɛ wɔ berɛ a, yebo kɔpɛ, sɛ dwudwolɛ ahoroɛ wɔ berɛ a, ɔkɔyakyi, na nimdeɛ koso, okofi berɛ. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Ofikyɛ yɛ nimdeɛ nni mu, na yɛ ngɔmhyɛ koso nni mu, <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />yeti sɛ bɔ odi mu ne ba a, bɔ onni mu ne kofi berɛ.<verse eid="1CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Mmerɛ bɔ né nde akwalaa ne, né me dwudwo kyɛ akwalaa, me dwene kyɛ akwalaa, na né mesusu nningyein nwo kyɛ akwalaa. Nakoso nyɛle panyi ne de, mayakyi ngwalaasɛm ne. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Kesaalae de, yɛnea buralɛ ahwehwɛ nu, yeti yɛnwu nikye ne wusi-wusi, nakoso mmerɛ bie kɔwa, bɔ yekonwu nikye yé. Kesaalae de, me nimdeɛ nni mu, nakoso sɔ mmerɛ ne, ngonya nimdeɛ bɔ odi mu te kyɛ bɔ ɔse me yé nala.<verse eid="1CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Kesaalae, nningyein nza he yeɛ ɔwɔ berɛ ɔ: gyidie, anidasoɛ, yeɛ ɔdɔ; nakoso bɔ ɔte piri<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Odi mu.”</char></note> wɔ nu yeɛ ole ɔdɔ.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Ɛmɔpena ɔdɔ, nakoso ɛmɔyere ɛmɔ nwo bɛpena honhom akyɛdeɛ nemɔ, ye titire ne, kyɛ ɛmɔ kɔhyɛ ngɔm. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Ofikyɛ bɔ ɔka dwudwolɛ ahoroɛ ne, ɔnga mma sona, mmom ɔka ma Nyameɛ; na ebiala nde yebo, nakoso ɔnate honhom naso ka nningyein krongron bɔ wafea ne. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Nakoso sona bɔ ɔhyɛ ngɔm ne de, ye dwudwolɛ ne ma mmenia nya ngɔsoɛ, ɔhyɛ bɛ nguraen, na ɔkyekye bɛ wora. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Sona bɔ ɔka dwudwolɛ ahoroɛ ne, ye bɔbɔ yeɛ onya ngɔsoɛ ɔ, nakoso bɔ ɔhyɛ ngɔm ne maa asafo ne nya ngɔsoɛ. <verse eid="1CO 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Ɔhale me ngome a, ahaa ɛmɔ mukoraati ɛmɔka dwudwolɛ ahoroɛ, nakoso, bɔ mekuro paa yeɛ ole kyɛ, ɛmɔ kɔhyɛ ngɔm. Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, bɔ ɔhyɛ ngɔm ne, ɔtra bɔ ɔka dwudwolɛ ahoroɛ ne, sana ebie kyire yebo kora ne wamaa asafo ne anya ngɔsoɛ.<verse eid="1CO 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Aliemaa mɔ, sɛ meba ɛmɔ berɛ mebaka dwudwolɛ ahoroɛ a, mvasoɛ beni yeɛ ɛmɔ konya ye wɔ so ɔ? Sana meka edwirɛ bie bɔ Nyameɛ aye ahyire me, nimdeɛ, ngɔmhyɛ anaa ngyerɛkyerɛ. <verse eid="1CO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Sɔ ala yeɛ nningyein bɔ ngoa nne nu te kyɛ atɛntɛnbɛn ne dwotai koso te ɔ. Sɛ kyɛbɔ bɛgyegye nanu anna berɛ a, ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ ne ebie anwu bɔ bɛbɔ ne? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Sɛ awɛen<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Totorobɛndo.”</char></note> ne anyegye yé a, nwa yeɛ okosiesie ye nwo kɔhɔ koɛ ɔ? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Sɔ ala yeɛ ɛmɔ koso, sɛ ɛmɔka dwudwolɛ bɔ bɛnde yebo a, ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ ne ebie anwu bɔ ɛmɔka ne? Ye de, né ɛmɔ dwudwo bɛgua mvrama nu. <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Nahorɛ nu, dwudwolɛ pee yeɛ ɔwɔ wiase ɔ, nakoso enu ebiala nne berɛ bɔ olle bɔ okyire ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Na sɛ mende dwudwolɛ bɔ sona ne ka nabo a, sona ne kobu me kyɛ nde wɔfoɛ, na me koso ngobu ye kyɛ ɔte wɔfoɛ. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Yeti ɛmɔ koso, ɔnate kyɛ ɛmɔ nye aboro paa bɔ ɛmɔpena honhom akyɛdeɛ nati, akyɛdeɛ bɔ ɔkɔmaa asafo ne konya ngɔsoɛ ne, ɛmɔbɔ mmɔden kyɛ ɛmɔ konya pee.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Yeti, ebiala bɔ ɔka dwudwolɛ foforɛ ne, ɔbɔ mmɔden kyɛ ɔkɔhora kohyire ye bo. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Ofikyɛ sɛ mefa dwudwolɛ foforɛ mebɔ mbaeɛ a, honhom akyɛdeɛ bɔ manya ye ne yeɛ ɔbɔ mbaeɛ ne ɔ, na m'adwene de, ɔnyɛ hwee. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Ye de nzu yeɛ ngɔyɛ ɔ? Ngɔfa honhom akyɛdeɛ ne ngɔbɔ mbaeɛ, ná mafa m'adwene koso mabɔ mbaeɛ. Ngɔfa honhom akyɛdeɛ ne ngɔto ayɛyie dwein, na mafa m'adwene koso mato ayɛyie dwein. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Na sɛ ɛmɔfa honhom akyɛdeɛ ne bɛbɔ mbaeɛ a, ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ né ebie mbaen bɔ ɔwɔ ɛmɔ nu ne alɛ́ ɛmɔ mbaeɛ naso “Amen,” mmerɛ bɔ ɔnze bɔ ɛmɔka nanwo hwee ne? <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Ɔwɔ nu, kyɛbɔ ɛda ase ne te pa, nakoso sona ne nngonya ngɔsoɛ biala. <verse eid="1CO 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Meda Nyameɛ ase paa kyɛ meka dwudwolɛ ahoroɛ pee metra ɛmɔ mukoraati ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />Nakoso asafo nanu de, ɔte pa kyɛ ngɔfa m'adwene ngɔha edwirɛ nnu, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ngohyirehyire mmenia, tra kyɛ ngɔfa dwudwolɛ foforɛ ngɔha edwirɛ apee-buru ɔ.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Aliemaa mɔ, nnɛmɔ dwene kyɛ ngwalaa, mmom ɛmɔyɛ ngwalaa mmaa-mmaa wɔ bɔne nu. Nakoso ɛmɔ dwene kyɛ mbanyi.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Mmenia bɔ bɛ nwo akwokwa.”</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Bahworɔ ye wɔ mmeraa nanu kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">“Ngɔfa dwudwolɛ foforɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">ne ɛwɔfoɛ konvi<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɛwɔfoɛ noa.”</char></note> ngodwudwo ngohyire mmenia hemɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">nakoso ɛhene po, bɛngotie me.” Awurade yeɛ waha ɔ.<verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Yeti bɛ bɔ benne benni ne yeɛ dwudwolɛ ahoroɛ te nzɛngyerɛneɛ ma bɛ ɔ, na ɔtte gyidifoɛ; na ngɔmhyɛ koso, ɔte nzɛngyerɛneɛ ma bɛ bɔ bɛte gyidifoɛ ne, na ɔtte bɛ bɔ bɛtte gyidifoɛ ne. <verse eid="1CO 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Sɛ asafo namukoraati yia nu, na ɛmɔ nu biala ka dwudwolɛ ahoroɛ, na sona foforɛ anaa ebie bɔ ɔtte gyidiniɛ ba berɛ a, aso ɔngɔha kyɛ ɛmɔ abɔ laen? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Nakoso sɛ ɛmɔ mukoraati ɛmɔhyɛ ngɔm, na sɛ ebie bɔ ɔtte gyidiniɛ anaa sona foforɛ ba berɛ a, ɛmɔ mukoraati ɛmɔ dwirɛ ne kɔha nikye bie kohyire ye, na ɔkɔmaa ɔkɔneɛnea ye nwo nu yé, <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />na wamaa ɛmɔ anwu bɔ ɔwɔ ye ahone nu ɔ. Ɛhene kɔmaa ɔkɔfa ye nyunu kɔbutu berɛ kɔsõ Nyameɛ, na waha kyɛ: “Amba, Nyameɛ wɔ ɛmɔ nu.”<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Ye de aliemaa mɔ, nzu yeɛ ɛmɔ kɔyɛ ɔ? Sɛ ɛmɔyia nu a, ɛyɛ a né ebie le edwein, ebie le ngyerɛkyerɛ, ebie le adiisɛm,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nyikyire.”</char></note> ebie le dwudwolɛ foforɛ, na ebie koso kora kyire dwudwolɛ foforɛ bo. Odikyɛ bɔ ɔkɔhɔ so namukoraati maa asafo ne nya ngɔsoɛ. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Sɛ ebie ka dwudwolɛ foforɛ a, ɛmɔma ɔyɛ mmenia nyɔ, waboso alaa yeɛ ole mmenia nza, na bɛha ye ngoko-ngoko. Na odikyɛ ebie kyire ye bo. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Nakoso sɛ ebiala nne berɛ bɔ okohyire yebo a, omua ye noa wɔ asafo nanu, na ɔne Nyameɛ ngome dwudwo. <verse eid="1CO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Adiifoɛ de, ɛmɔma nyɔ anaa nza dwudwo, na bɛ ngaa ne neɛnea bɔ bɛka nanu yé. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Nakoso sɛ Nyameɛ ye nikye bie kyire bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ nanu bie a, ye de bɔ ogu so odwudwo ne, ma omua ye noa. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Ɛmɔ mukoraati, ɛmɔ kɔhora bɛkɔhyɛ ngɔm, kõ yie a, ne kõ ahyɛ ye deɛ, na wamaa ɛmɔ nu biala asua nikye afi nu, na wahyɛ ɛmɔ mukoraati nguraen, <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />na odikyɛ adiifoɛ nemɔ hyɛ bɛ honhom akyɛdeɛ naso. <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />Ofikyɛ Nyameɛ de, ɔtte ebie bɔ ɔyɛ ye nikye basabasa, mmom ɔte asomdwie Nyameɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Na kyɛbɔ ɔkɔso wɔ akrongronfoɛ asafo mukoraati nu ne, <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />ɛmɔma mmrasua mua bɛ noa wɔ asafo nanu. Ofikyɛ bɛlle ye nwo atee kyɛ bɛdwudwo, mmom kyɛbɔ Mmeraa ne ka ne, ɛmɔma bɛbrɛ bɛ nwo ase. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Sɛ bɛpena kyɛ besua nikye bie a, ma bɛ bisa bɛ humɔ wɔ awuro. Ofikyɛ ɔte animguaseɛ ma brasua kyɛ ɔkodwudwo wɔ asafo nanu.<verse eid="1CO 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Ɛmɔ berɛ yeɛ Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne fi wale anaa? Anaa ɛmɔ ngome yeɛ wato ɛmɔ ɔ? <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Sɛ ebie adwene yɛ ye kyɛ ɔte diifoɛ anaa ole honhom akyɛdeɛ a, odikyɛ onwu ye kyɛ, bɔ metworɔ mebrɛ ɛmɔ ne, ɔte ahyɛdeɛ bɔ ofi Awurade berɛ. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Na sɛ ebie nne ɛhe ndonu a, ye koso, bɛngole ye bɛngɔto nu. <verse eid="1CO 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Yeti nniema mɔ, ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye boro kyɛ ɛmɔ kɔhyɛ ngɔm, nakoso nnɛmɔsi bɛ bɔ bɛka dwudwolɛ ahoroɛ ne atee. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Mmom ɛmɔfa nhyehyɛɛ bɛto nikye biala nwo, na wamaa wahɔso pɛpɛɛpɛ.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Afei aliemaa mɔ, mekaye ɛmɔ nzɛmba bɔ nga ngyirele ɛmɔ, bɔ ɛmɔle bɛtole nu ne, ná ɛmɔ asɔ nu ne. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />Na sɛ ɛmɔsɔ nzɛmba bɔ nga ngyirele ɛmɔ nanu yé a, nzɛmba ne kɔmaa bɛkole ɛmɔ ngoa. Sɛ wamma ye sɔ a, ye de ɛmɔ alɛ́ bali mbaen.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />Nningyein bɔ ye nwo hia bɔ nni moa nyane ne, ɛhene yeɛ mva mmane ɛmɔ ne, na ebie yeɛ ole kyɛ: Tworɔnzɛm ne maa yɛnwu kyɛ, yɛ bɔne ti yeɛ Kristo wuli ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />Na bɛsiele ye, na kyẽa bɔ ɔtɔ so nza ne, bɛtingyele ye, kyɛbɔ Tworɔnzɛm ne ka ne. <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />Na ɔyele ye nwo ali hyirele Kefa,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kefa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ala yeɛ bɛfrɛ ye Petro ne.</char></note> afei buru-ne-nyɔ ne. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Ɛhene si ne, ɔyele ye nwo ali hyirele aliemaa mɔ kɔbo 500 mmerɛ komapɛ, bɛ nu pee te ase, na ebiemɔ koso ala wɔ ewue nu. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Afei ɔyele ye nwo ali hyirele Yakobo, na ye si ne, asomafoɛ namukoraati. <verse eid="1CO 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Na bɔ ɔpɛ yebo ne, ɔyele ye nwo ali hyire me bɔ mayɛ kyɛ ebie bɔ ye mmerɛ anzo bɔ bɛwole ye ne. <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Me yeɛ nde kaa koraa wɔ asomafoɛ nanu ɔ, na menvata kyɛ bɛfrɛ me somafoɛ po, ofikyɛ nduli me nye nziele Nyameɛ asafo naso paa.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ndanene Nyameɛ asafo ne nye paa.”</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Nakoso Nyameɛ adom ti yeɛ nde kyɛbɔ nde ye. Na ye adom bɔ ɔfa lole me ne anyɛ mbaen, ofikyɛ nyɛle adwuma ndrale bɛ mukoraati, nná me mmɔdemmɔ ɔ, na mmom Nyameɛ adom bɔ ɔboka me ne ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Yeti sɛ me ahɔ oo, sɛ bɛ ahɔ oo, nzɛmba komapɛ nala yeɛ yɛka ɔ, na ɛmɔ koso ɛmɔle bɛlili.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Na sɛ yɛka kyɛ, batingye Kristo bafi ewue nu a, nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔ nu biemɔ ka kyɛ, awufo tingyele biala nne berɛ ne? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Na sɛ ɔte amba kyɛ bɛngɔtingye awufo de a, na ye de Kristo koso, bandingye ye. <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />Na sɛ ɔte amba kyɛ bandingye Kristo a, mvasoɛ biala nne y'asɛnka naso, na ɛmɔ gyidie koso ayɛ mbaen. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Na sɛ ɔte nahorɛ kyɛ bɛngɔtingye awufo a, ye de yali adanzeɛ bɔ ɔtte nahorɛ yafa Nyameɛ nwo. Ofikyɛ yɛnwa watingye Kristo, aberɛ bɔ wandingye ye ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Na sɛ bɛngɔtingye awufo de a, na ye de bandingye Kristo. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Na sɛ bandingye Kristo de a, mvasoɛ biala nne ɛmɔ gyidie naso, na ɛmɔtɛ́ te ɛmɔ bɔne nu. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Na bɛ bɔ bawuwu wɔ Kristo nu ne, bamini. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Na sɛ asetena he anu ngome yeɛ yɛle anidasoɛ wɔ Kristo nu a, ye de ahaa yɛyɛ anwunvo yɛtra ebiala.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Nakoso bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, batingye Kristo bafi ewue nu, na ye yeɛ ɔte mmaa bɔ oli moa wɔ bɛ bɔ bawu nanu ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Na kyɛbɔ ɔnate sona so yeɛ ewue wale ne, sɔ ala yeɛ ɔnate sona so yeɛ bɛkotingye awufo ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Na kyɛbɔ Adam ti ebiala wu ne, sɔ ala yeɛ Kristo ti, ebiala konya ngoa ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Nakoso bahyehyɛ ye nnidisoɛ-nnidisoɛ: Kristo yeɛ ole aba bɔ oli moa ne, yesi ne, bɛ bɔ bɛte Kristo deɛ ne koli so, mmerɛ bɔ wawa ne.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kyire kyɛ: “Wawa Ye Ahennie nu ne.”</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Ɛhene si ne, awieɛ ne kɔwa, na ɔkɔfa Ahennie ne kɔma ye Baba ne ye Nyameɛ mmerɛ bɔ wasɛkye tumidie, awaen ne ahennie biala ne. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Na odikyɛ odi bia tonn koodwu kyɛ Nyameɛ kɔfa ye atamfo mukoraati kogua ye gya bo. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Ɔtamfo bɔ ɔpɛ yebo koraa bɔ ɔkɔsɛkye ye, yeɛ ole ewue. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Ofikyɛ Nyameɛ “afa nikye biala agua ye gya bo.” Na sɛ ɔka kyɛ “wafa nikye biala wagua ye gya bo” a, enu la berɛ pefee kyɛ, Bɔ ɔfale nningyein ne guale ye gya bo ne de, ɔbokka so. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Na sɛ ɔfa nningyein mukoraati gua ye gya bo yie a, Baa ne koso kɔfa ye nwo kowura Nyameɛ bɔ ɔfale nningyein mukoraati guale ye gya bo ne bo, ná Nyameɛ ayɛ nikye biala ama ebiala.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Sɛ ɔtte sɔ a, bɛ bɔ bɛbɔ bɛ asu bɛkɔ ewue nu ne, mvasoɛ beni yeɛ benya ye wɔ so ɔ? Na sɛ bɛngɔtingye awufo a, nzuati yeɛ bɛbɔ bɛ asu bɛkɔ ewue nu ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Ye de, nzuati yeɛ asane to yɛ mmerɛ biala ɔ? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Daa biala, mene ewue bɔ mbu-ne-mbu. Aliemaa mɔ, nahorɛ dwirɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ mefa ɛmɔ mehoɔhoa me nwo wɔ y'Awurade Kristo Yesu nu. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Sɛ mene ngaka hone kyɛbɔ ebiemɔ yɛ ye wɔ Efeso ne a, ahaa mvasoɛ beni yeɛ ngonya ye ɔ? Na sɛ awufo ngotingye de a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:32">“Ɛmɔma yɛdidi, na yɛno,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 15:32">ofikyɛ ɛhema ne yawu.”<verse eid="1CO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Nnɛmɔ ma bɛlaka-laka ɛmɔ, adamvoa bɔ ɔttemaye ne, ɔsɛkye suban pa. <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye la berɛ, na ɛmɔyakyi bɔne bɔ ɛmɔyɛ ne, ofikyɛ ɛmɔ nu biemɔ nze Nyameɛ nwo hwee. Ɛhe de meka maa ɛmɔ nyunu gua ase.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Nakoso ebie kobisa kyɛ: “Atee beni yeɛ bɛkɔfa so bɛkotingye awufo ɔ? Na nipadua beni po yeɛ bɛkɔfa bɛkɔwa ɔ?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Wɔ bɔ w'adwene nyɛ adwuma!<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Kwasea.”</char></note> Bɔ edua ne, ɔnvifi sana wawu kora. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Afei koso, nná bakaa bɔ ofifili ne yeɛ eluale ɔ, mmom né ɔte ye mmaa, ebia hwiit anaa bakaa foforɛ mmaa. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Nakoso Nyameɛ maa onyi yɛ bakaa bɔ okuro ɔ, mmaa biala le ye nwo so bakaa. <verse eid="1CO 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Anwoɔnaen mukoraati tte kõ, sona le ye deɛ, ngaka le bɛ deɛ, nnomaa le bɛ deɛ, yeɛ egyein koso le ye deɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne te sorongo, yeɛ nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ aseɛ he aso ne koso te sorongo; nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro né anuonyam ngome, yeɛ bɔ ɔwɔ ase né deɛ ngome. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Eyia anuonyam ngome, yeɛ ɛsraen anuonyam ngome, na nzramaa koso anuonyam ngome; bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, nzramaa po, ebiala le ye anuonyam deɛ.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Sɔ ala yeɛ awufo bɔ bɛkotingye bɛ ne koso te ɔ. Bɔ ɔporɔ yeɛ bɛdua ɔ, na bɔ bɛtingye ye ne de, ɔmborɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Bɛdua ye animguaseɛ nu, bɛtingye ye anuonyam nu. Bɔ bɛdua ne yɛ mmerɛ, nakoso bɛtingye ye tumi nu. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Anwoɔnaen<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Anwoɔnaen nipadua.”</char></note> yeɛ bɛdua ɔ, na bɛtingye ye honhom nipadua nu. Na sɛ anwoɔnaen nipadua wɔ berɛ a, ye de honhom nipadua koso wɔ berɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Yeti bahworɔ kyɛ: “Adam bɔ oli moa ne yɛle teasefoɛ.”<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɔkra bɔ ɔte ase.”</char></note> Na Adam bɔ ɔpɛ yebo ne te honhom bɔ ɔma ngoa. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Nná honhom ne yeɛ oli moa ɔ, mmom anwoɔnaen ne yeɛ oli moa ɔ, ɛhene si kora yeɛ honhom ne ba ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Sona bɔ oli moa ne fi aseɛ he aso, ná nnɛterɛ yeɛ bɛfa bɛyɛle ye ɔ, na sona bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ ne fi anwuro. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Kyɛbɔ sona bɔ ofi nnɛterɛ nu ne te ne, sɔ ala yeɛ bɛ bɔ bɛfale nnɛterɛ bɛbɔle bɛ ne te ɔ; na kyɛbɔ sona bɔ ofi anwuro ne te ne, sɔ ala yeɛ bɛ bɔ bɛfi anwuro ne te ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Na kyɛbɔ yɛte kyɛ bɔ ofi nnɛterɛ nu ne, sɔ ala yeɛ yɛkɔyɛ kyɛ bɔ ofi anwuro ne ɔ.<verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Aliemaa mɔ, meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ anwoɔnaen ne mogya ngɔhora ngɔhɔ Nyameɛ Ahennie nanu, na sɔ ala yeɛ bɔ ɔporɔ koso nngonya bɔ ɔmborɔ ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Ɛmɔnea, meka edwirɛ krongron bɔ wafea bie mekyire ɛmɔ, yeɛ ole kyɛ: Nná yɛ mukoraati yeɛ yɛkowu ɔ, mmom yɛ mukoraati yɛkɔsesa <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />mvum nu, te kyɛ bɔ ɛbɔ wɔ nye perɛ ne, wɔ awɛen<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Totorobɛndo.”</char></note> bɔ ɔpɛ yebo nanu. Sɛ bɛbɔ awɛen<note caller="#" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Totorobɛndo.” </char></note> ne a, bɛkotingye awufo bɛkɔhɔ tebea bɔ ɔmborɔ nu, na yɛ de yɛkɔsesa. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Na odikyɛ nipadua bɔ ɔporɔ ne wura bɔ ɔmborɔ, na odikyɛ nipadua bɔ owu ne wura bɔ onwu. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Na sɛ bɔ ɔporɔ ne wura bɔ ɔmborɔ, ná bɔ owu ne wura bɔ onwu a, ɛberɛ yeɛ sɔ dwirɛ bɔ bahworɔ ne kɔwa nu kyɛ: “Wame ewue koraa.”<verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />“Ewue, wɔ ngunim ne wɔ ni?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 15:55">Ewue, nikye bɔ ɛfa wowɔ ne wɔ ni?”<verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Nikye bɔ ɔfa ewue ba yeɛ ole bɔne, na mmeraa yeɛ ɔmaa bɔne nya tumi ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Nakoso, yɛda Nyameɛ ase paa; ɔnate y'Awurade Yesu Kristo so amaa yali ngunim.<verse eid="1CO 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Yeti, nniema mɔ, ɛmɔgyina pindinn, nnɛmɔ hinhim, ɛmɔyɛ pee wɔ Awurade adwuma nanu daa, na ɛmɔse kyɛ ɛmɔ fɛɛ ngɔyɛ mbaen wɔ Awurade nu.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Afei ndoboa bɔ ɛmɔdide bɛma akrongronfoɛ ne, akwankyerɛ bɔ mva mmane Galatia asafo ne, ɛmɔfa ɛhene ala bɛyɛ adwuma. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Dapɛn nanu kyẽa bɔ oli moa ne, ɛmɔ nu biala nea bɔ ole ye naso, na ɔye nikye bie sie, ná wamma kyɛ maadwu berɛ ne, bekye bɔ ɛmɔ baale ndoboa ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Sɛ meba a, bɛ bɔ ɛmɔlɛle bɛ bɛtole nu wɔ ɛmɔ krataa nanu ne, bɛ yeɛ ngɔsoma bɛ maa bɛkɔfa ɛmɔ akyɛdeɛ ne bɛkɔhɔ Yerusalem ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Na sɛ ye nwo bahia kyɛ mekɔ bie a, mene bɛ kɔhɔ.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />Ngɔfa Makedonia kora né mawa ɛmɔ berɛ, ofikyɛ mayɛ m'adwene kyɛ ngɔfa Makedonia. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Na medɛ́ medi kyɛ ngɔtena ɛmɔ berɛ kaa, ebia ngɔtena ɛmɔ berɛ maa ayirɛ kɔpɛ nu, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɛmɔ kosoma me atee kaa maa ngɔhɔ nekaa bɔ mekɔ ne. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Menguro kyɛ ngonwu ɛmɔ kaa na mapɛ nu mahɔ, mmom me nye la so kyɛ, sɛ Awurade ma atee a, ngoli mmerɛ kaa wɔ ɛmɔ berɛ. <verse eid="1CO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Nakoso ngɔtena Efeso maa Pentekoste afahyɛ ne kodwu so, <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />ofikyɛ anoa kandinga bie bɔ adwuma pee wɔ nu abukye ama me, nakoso bɛ bɔ badwɔso batia ne sone.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Sɛ Timoteo ba a, ɛmɔbɔ mmɔden kyɛ ɛmɔngɔma esuronyi biala ngɔha ye mmerɛ bɔ ɔwɔ ɛmɔ nwo berɛ ne, ofikyɛ Awurade adwuma bɔ meyɛ ne, ɛhene biala yeɛ ɔyɛ ne. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Nnɛmaa ebiala bu ye animtia. Ɛmɔgua ye atee asomdwie nu ma ɔbra me nwo wa, na mene aliemaa nemɔ nwondɛ ye.<verse eid="1CO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Yɛliema Apolo de, masrɛ ye alaa kyɛ ɔne aliemaa nemɔ bra ɛmɔ berɛ. Nakoso ɔyɛlle ye adwene kyɛ ɔba dɔ kesaalae, nakoso sɛ onya atee ne a, ɔkɔwa.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye la berɛ, ɛmɔgyina pindinn wɔ gyidie nanu, ɛmɔnya akukuduro kyɛ mmrienzua, na ɛmɔyɛ se. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Nikye biala bɔ ɛmɔyɛ ne, ɛmɔyɛ ye wɔ ɔdɔ nu.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Aliemaa mɔ, ɛmɔse kyɛ Stefana ne ye abusuafoɛ yeɛ bɛte mmaa bɔ oli moa wɔ Akaia ɔ, na bɛtule bɛ nwo besiele berɛ kyɛ bɛkɔsõ akrongronfoɛ ne. <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />Ɛmɔ koso, ɛmɔ berɛ ɛmɔ nwo ase bɛma mmenia bɔ bɛte sɔ ne, ɔne ebiala bɔ wafa ye nwo wawura adwuma he anu, ná ɔyɛ adwuma serɛ ne. <verse eid="1CO 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Ɔyɛ me fɛ paa kyɛ Stefana, Fotunato ne Akaiko awa wa ɔ, ofikyɛ baasi ɛmɔ gya nu. <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />Na bamaa mene ɛmɔ mukoraati ahone atɔ yɛ kunu.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Asafo bɔ bɛwɔ Asia ne nwa bɛkyea ɛmɔ. Akwila ne Prisila, ne asafo bɔ beyia nu wɔ b'awuro berɛ ne nwa bɛkyea ɛmɔ paa wɔ Awurade nu. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Aliemaa mɔ bɔ bɛwɔ wa namukoraati nwa bɛkyea ɛmɔ. Ɛmɔfa mveanoɛ bɔ ɔte krongron bɛhyeɛhyea ɛmɔ nwo.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Me Paul, me koso mekyea ɛmɔ. Me bɔbɔ me sa yeɛ mva ndworɔle ɔ. <verse eid="1CO 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Sɛ ebie wɔ berɛ bɔ onguro Awurade dwirɛ a, mmusue ha ye. O y'Awurade, bra! <verse eid="1CO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Awurade Yesu adom ha ɛmɔ.<verse eid="1CO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔ wɔ Kristo Yesu nu ne, medɔ ɛmɔ mukoraati.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>